          "redirectURL": "",
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"events\":[{\"id\":\"6a556fa8514c288adff72930\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"BALCONY - Festival Pass £225\",\"description\":\"<p>Please reserve your Main Screen Festival Pass (BALCONY) seat here! Once you have purchased your seat, it is yours for the entire festival, so please keep a note of your seat number. You'll find your seat number in your confirmation email or by visiting <a href=\\\"https://frightfest.eventive.org/tickets\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">My Tickets</a> and clicking \\\"Show barcode\\\" next to your Pass.&nbsp;</p><p>Your pass only guarantees your seat in the <strong>Main Screen</strong>. For discovery screen films, you will need a separate ticket. There will be a number of free discovery tickets made available to passholder on Saturday 22nd August 2026 at 12pm.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Closer to the time you will be sent further details and a 'discovery ticket' pass which will allow you to log in and order discovery tickets.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries, please email <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For more information on accessibility please see the dedicate page under the 'Menu' Header.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>PLEASE NOTE THIS IS AN OVER 18'S EVENT ONLY</strong>. Valid ID may be required. All ticket sales are final and we do not offer refunds.&nbsp;</p>\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Balcony\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a53b02ab6630c9cddf931b3\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Balcony\",\"short_name\":\"Main Screen - Balcony - Festival Pass\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"23-26 Leicester Square, London.  WC2H 7JY\",\"default_capacity\":213,\"color\":\"#e31428\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"e7b1b1d8-d8ea-14bf-df68-a8ed16b97bcc\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"Balcony\",\"color\":\"#E9803D\",\"_id\":\"6a5fc18278ab903a883d91bd\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#b9b8b9\",\"_id\":\"6a5fc18278ab903a883d91be\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"\",\"color\":\"#992C4E\",\"_id\":\"6a5fc18278ab903a883d91bf\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-08-27T14:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-31T22:59:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"tickets_button_label\":\"Choose your seat\",\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":247,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a577144cffceb098a82c17b\",\"name\":\"Balcony\",\"price\":22500,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":214,\"quantity_sold\":214,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"1\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-15T14:09:24.048Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{\"cover\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784370850617temp-1784370850611-cover.jpg\",\"avatar\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784370850814temp-1784370850805-avatar.jpg\"},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Your order and payment have been processed successfully, Thank you. Please see the details of your order below.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your pass guarantees your seat in the <strong>Main Screen</strong> for the duration of the festival. Films in the Discovery Screens will require a separate ticket.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>A limited number of free discovery film tickets will be available to pass-holders, free of charge closer to the festival.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can either print your ticket or simply download your confirmation and QR code to keep them handy for scanning upon arrival. Please ensure it is <strong>this</strong> barcode you present for scanning.&nbsp;You will be issued with a lanyard which should be worn at all times in the Cinema. Please also make a note of your seat number.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: <strong>This is an over 18’s event</strong> and no children are allowed entry. All sales are final. FrightFest does not refund tickets.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please take a moment to read the FrightFest Code of Conduct which can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://frightfest.co.uk/conduct/&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</a></p><p><br></p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a556f9098bc7672bae1c3c7\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"CIRCLE - Festival Pass £265\",\"description\":\"<p>Please reserve your Main Screen Festival Pass (CIRCLE) seat here! Once you have purchased your seat, it is yours for the entire festival, so please keep a note of your seat number. You'll find your seat number in your confirmation email or by visiting <a href=\\\"https://frightfest.eventive.org/tickets\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">My Tickets</a> and clicking \\\"Show barcode\\\" next to your Pass.&nbsp;</p><p>Your pass only guarantees your seat in the <strong>Main Screen</strong>. For discovery screen films, you will need a separate ticket. There will be a number of free discovery tickets made available to passholder on Saturday 22nd August 2026 at 12pm.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Closer to the time you will be sent further details and a 'discovery ticket' pass which will allow you to log in and order discovery tickets.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries, please email <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For more information on accessibility please see the dedicate page under the 'Menu' Header.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>PLEASE NOTE THIS IS AN OVER 18'S EVENT ONLY</strong>. Valid ID may be required. All ticket sales are final and we do not offer refunds.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Please take a moment to read the FrightFest Code of Conduct which can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://frightfest.co.uk/conduct/&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</a></p><p><br></p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Circle - Festival Pass\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a53ad6e3cac946a2bed8fdc\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Circle - Festival Pass\",\"short_name\":\"Main Screen - Circle\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"23-26 Leicester Square, London.  WC2H 7JY\",\"default_capacity\":90,\"color\":\"#e31428\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"1cce5ff1-7a26-4ac1-f787-515410c1fac2\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"Circle\",\"color\":\"#FCA700\",\"_id\":\"6a739b9447498b3a15f4b3b7\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#cdcacb\",\"_id\":\"6a739b9447498b3a15f4b3b8\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-08-27T14:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-31T22:59:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"tickets_button_label\":\"Choose your seat\",\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":90,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a5772021b3d4b3b74d1cdd5\",\"name\":\"Circle\",\"price\":26500,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":89,\"quantity_sold\":89,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"1\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-22T00:49:25.879Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{\"cover\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784451582044temp-1784451582038-cover.jpg\",\"avatar\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784451582239temp-1784451582231-avatar.jpg\"},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Your order and payment have been processed successfully, Thank you. Please see the details of your order below.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your pass guarantees your seat in the <strong>Main Screen</strong> for the duration of the festival. Films in the Discovery Screens will require a separate ticket.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>A limited number of free discovery film tickets will be available to pass-holders, free of charge closer to the festival.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can either print your ticket or simply download your confirmation and QR code to keep them handy for scanning upon arrival. Please ensure it is <strong>this</strong> barcode you present for scanning.&nbsp;You will be issued with a lanyard which should be worn at all times in the Cinema. Please also make a note of your seat number.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: <strong>This is an over 18’s event</strong> and no children are allowed entry. All sales are final. FrightFest does not refund tickets.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please take a moment to read the FrightFest Code of Conduct which can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://frightfest.co.uk/conduct/&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</a></p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a556fbda4cbfed68d60d786\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"Day Pass - Thursday £36\",\"description\":\"<p>Please reserve your Main Screen Thursday seat here! Once you have selected your seat it is yours for the entire day, so please keep a note of your seat number. You'll find your seat number in your confirmation email or by visiting <a href=\\\"https://frightfest.eventive.org/tickets\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">My Tickets</a> and clicking \\\"Show barcode\\\" next to your Pass.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your pass only guarantees your seat in the <strong>Main Screen</strong>. For discovery screen films, you will need a separate ticket. There will be a number of free discovery tickets made available to passholder on Saturday 22nd August 2026 at 12pm.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Closer to the time you will be sent further details and a 'discovery ticket' pass which will allow you to log in and order discovery tickets.&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries, please email <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For more information on accessibility please see the dedicate page under the 'Menu' Header.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>PLEASE NOTE THIS IS AN OVER 18'S EVENT ONLY</strong>. Valid ID may be required. All ticket sales are final and we do not offer refunds.&nbsp;</p>\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Thursday Day Pass\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a53b8f93c7ca29fdcd72476\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Thursday Day Pass\",\"short_name\":\"Main Screen - Thursday Day Pass\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"23-26 Leicester Square, London.  WC2H 7JY.\",\"default_capacity\":108,\"color\":\"#221cea\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"63c769cd-710e-ff3b-80ef-daedeea99623\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#B2AFB0\",\"_id\":\"6a59791c92ae78ac7c00cfdd\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"Day Pass\",\"color\":\"#00A5D6\",\"_id\":\"6a59791c92ae78ac7c00cfde\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-08-27T14:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-27T22:59:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"tickets_button_label\":\"Choose your seat\",\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":112,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a557a5bae382b98bb9c5953\",\"name\":\"Day Pass\",\"price\":3600,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":112,\"quantity_sold\":112,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"2\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-05T21:07:39.384Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{\"cover\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784763147638temp-1784763147634-cover.jpg\",\"avatar\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784763147867temp-1784763147859-avatar.jpg\"},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Your order and payment have been processed successfully, Thank you. Please see the details of your order below.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your pass guarantees your seat in the <strong>Main Screen</strong> for the duration of the day. Films in the Discovery Screens will require a separate ticket.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>A limited number of free discovery film tickets will be available to pass-holders, free of charge closer to the festival.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can either print your ticket or simply download your confirmation and QR code to keep them handy for scanning upon arrival. You will be issued with a lanyard which should be worn at all times in the Cinema. Please also make a note of your seat number.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: <strong>This is an over 18’s event</strong> and no children are allowed entry. All sales are final. FrightFest does not refund tickets.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Please take a moment to read the FrightFest Code of Conduct which can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://frightfest.co.uk/conduct/&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</a></p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a53fc8c8531f11b7c42fd0e\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"STALLS - Festival Pass £265\",\"description\":\"<p>Please reserve your Main Screen Festival Pass (STALLS) seat here! Once you have purchased your seat, it is yours for the entire festival, so please keep a note of your seat number. You'll find your seat number in your confirmation email or by visiting <a href=\\\"https://frightfest.eventive.org/tickets\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">My Tickets</a> and clicking \\\"Show barcode\\\" next to your Pass.&nbsp;</p><p>Your pass only guarantees your seat in the <strong>Main Screen</strong>. For discovery screen films, you will need a separate ticket. There will be a number of free discovery tickets made available to passholder on Saturday 22nd August 2026 at 12pm.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Closer to the time you will be sent further details and a 'discovery ticket' pass which will allow you to log in and order discovery tickets.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries, please email <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For more information on accessibility please see the dedicate page under the 'Menu' Header.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>PLEASE NOTE THIS IS AN OVER 18'S EVENT ONLY</strong>. Valid ID may be required. All ticket sales are final and we do not offer refunds.&nbsp;</p>\",\"short_description\":\"Festival Pass - Stalls - Seat Reservation\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Stalls - Festival Pass\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a53a949d36d679ec096fbe2\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Stalls - Festiv