nd here: <a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18. ID may be required. All sales are final and no refunds are given.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a5ea70846d929fd78f8b195\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"DRAG\",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Single Tickets\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a53d79a6c5535dfd9936a4d\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Single Tickets\",\"short_name\":\"Main Screen - Single Tickets\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"\",\"default_capacity\":57,\"color\":\"#f22313\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"aad0d885-2851-1b2a-2d4a-7ab95f4b7deb\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#B2AFB0\",\"_id\":\"6a6e3c9a1dde808a7926d17e\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"Single Ticket\",\"color\":\"#F53F3F\",\"_id\":\"6a6e3c9a1dde808a7926d17f\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-08-28T19:45:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-28T21:31:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity\":60,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a5ea70846d929fd78f8b198\",\"name\":\"Single Ticket\",\"price\":1499,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":60,\"quantity_sold\":60,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"2\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e04a\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"FrightFest 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5dd16a51cb714c002f548a83\",\"name\":\"DRAG\",\"sort_key\":\"DRAG\",\"description\":\"<p>Co-produced by Danny DeVito, a fun horror comedy of errors where nothing is what it seems and events snowball into a dark, twisting mystery. Two sisters with a contentious relationship decide to rob a rural home in upstate New York. The simple robbery turns into a nightmare when one of them throws out her back and becomes immobilized on the second floor. As the clock ticks and pain sets in, the chaotic night spirals further out of control as they embark on an agonizing journey to make it out before the shady homeowner returns.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784577371730temp-1784577371551-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"86\",\"language\":\"ENGLISH\",\"country\":\"USA\",\"premiere\":\"UK\",\"rating\":\"18\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Raviv, Ullman, Greg Yagointzer\",\"cast\":\"Lizzy Caplan, Lucy DeVito, John Stamos, Christine Ko\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.504Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:44:47.646Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-15T20:54:28.163Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for your order.&nbsp;Please find below your ticket. You just need to produce this on your phone where a member of our team will scan it.&nbsp;<strong>Please arrive on time – there are no trailers.&nbsp;Latecomers may be denied entry.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PLEASE NOTE:- FrightFest is a horror, fantasy, science fiction and thriller film based event for over 18s. Films shown will feature an assortment of the following: supernatural/alien threats, strong language, upsetting scenes, violence, gore, blood, rape, suicide, monstrous menace, tobacco products, creature mayhem, psychological intimidation, sexual imagery, death, child endangerment, maiming, religious profanity, abusive behaviour, bullying, nudity, drug use, strobe lighting and racial stereotyping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: This is an <strong>over 18’s</strong> event and no children are allowed entry.&nbsp;All sales are final.&nbsp;<strong>FrightFest does not refund tickets</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please ensure you have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct before attending. This can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><