5dd16a51cb714c002f548a83\",\"name\":\"RECLUSE\",\"sort_key\":\"RECLUSE\",\"description\":\"<p>Working as a movie audio engineer for movies, Joan is obsessed with sounds. This  fascination becomes vital when she is summoned to her family’s New England mansion to tend to her severely burned and bedridden father. While reconnecting with her dad’s hired help, Joan can’t shake the ghosts of her past, largely tied to her mother’s long-unsolved disappearance. But something else isn’t right. Initially just figurative, those ghosts may in fact be literal and are possibly connected to her father’s dabbling in the occult. As Joan is about to find out, the truth is much scarier than she could’ve imagined.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784579272352temp-1784579272155-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"102\",\"language\":\"ENGLISH\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"premiere\":\"UK\",\"rating\":\"18\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Henry Chaisson\",\"cast\":\"Sasha Frolova, Xander Berkeley, Toby Poser, Mia Vallet\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.589Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:40:01.391Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T12:11:18.996Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"custom_e