.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a5ea71546d929fd78f8b273\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"THE ALICE PARADOX \",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe West End - Discovery Screen 1 - Accesible Guest\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a53dae99ed7d0afac6768d8\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe West End - Discovery Screen 1 - Accesible Guest\",\"short_name\":\"Discovery Screen 1\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"ODEON Luxe West End, 38a Leicester Square. London WC2H 7DX.\",\"default_capacity\":168,\"color\":\"#7cccf2\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"aab97eef-e8b0-1520-f9b9-ed86cc260a7d\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#4176A5\",\"_id\":\"6a59799c52f538ebc043519b\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#B2AFB0\",\"_id\":\"6a59799c52f538ebc043519c\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"color\":\"#FBA700\",\"_id\":\"6a59799c52f538ebc043519d\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"label\":\"Single Ticket\",\"color\":\"#F53F3F\",\"_id\":\"6a59799c52f538ebc043519e\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-08-29T17:30:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-29T19:13:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":168,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a5ea71546d929fd78f8b276\",\"name\":\"Single Ticket\",\"price\":1499,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":119,\"quantity_sold\":119,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"4\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null},{\"id\":\"6a5fba61f27a1700d66c473f\",\"name\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":39,\"quantity_sold\":40,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"3\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[\"6a804e190a759551798b743a\",\"6a858c1b401c5b05fa64df30\"],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e0b3\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"FrightFest 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5dd16a51cb714c002f548a83\",\"name\":\"THE ALICE PARADOX\",\"sort_key\":\"ALICE PARADOX, THE\",\"description\":\"<p>Depicting a famous thought experiment in Quantum Mechanics, Alice travels back in time and is transported into an alternate version of the recent past. Trapped in a world which prizes collectivism over individuality, Alice is forced to confront her life choices, grappling with profound questions about identity, fate, and the search for meaning. Philosophical science fiction grounded in real-world physics and inspired by the stylistic tones of directors Orson Welles and Ridley Scott, this new perspective on the genre explores the cosmic and spiritual feelings stirred in scientists as they study nature at the grandest scale. </p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784579751931temp-1784579751845-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"85\",\"language\":\"ENGLISH\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"premiere\":\"World\",\"rating\":\"18\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"William Brooke\",\"cast\":\"Jessica Kinsey, Gwithian Evans, Madeleine Smith, Jeffrey Kissoon.\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e02c\",\"name\":\"First Blood\",\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.644Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:37:18.405Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T11:44:27.409Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for your order.&nbsp;Please find below your ticket. You just need to produce this on your phone where a member of our team will scan it.&nbsp;<strong>Please arrive on time – there are no trailers.&nbsp;Latecomers may be denied entry.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PLEASE NOTE:- FrightFest is a horror, fantasy, science fiction and thriller film based event for over 18s. Films shown will feature an assortment of the following: supernatural/alien threats, strong language, upsetting scenes, violence, gore, blood, rape, suicide, monstrous menace, tobacco products, creature mayhem, psychological intimidation, sexual imagery, death, child endangerment, maiming, religious profanity, abusive behaviour, bullying, nudity, drug use, strobe lighting and racial stereotyping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: This is an <strong>over 18’s</strong> event and no children are allowed entry.&nbsp;All sales are final.&nbsp;<strong>FrightFest does not refund tickets</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please ensure you have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct before attending. This can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18. ID may be required. All sales are final and no refunds are given.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a5ea8a4f4ac0bac8eff48ae\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"GHOSTKEEPER\",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Discovery Screen 4\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a4d7692d104ae98644c1bbc\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Discovery Screen 4\",\"short_name\":\"Discovery Screen 4\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"23-26 Leicester Square, London.  WC2H 7JY.\",\"default_capacity\":40,\"color\":\"#c8cdd0\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"6b3f0bd6-f219-b12b-c112-ce0741445a23\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#4176A5\",\"_id\":\"6a91747e38c1ba4a4427323c\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"Single Ticket\",\"color\":\"#F53F3F\",\"_id\":\"6a91747e38c1ba4a4427323d\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"color\":\"#FBA700\",\"_id\":\"6a91747e38c1ba4a4427323e\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#B2AFB0\",\"_id\":\"6a91747e38c1ba4a4427323f\"}]},\"