e  4K restoration of the Canuxploitation supernatural slasher classic based on the Wendigo legend. During a New Year’s Eve snowmobiling trip, three friends veer off the path to explore a private property. Stranded by a heavy snowfall, they stumble upon an abandoned hotel and seek refuge for the night. But before long, they meet a menacing woman who shares the building with her knife-wielding son and a mysterious creature who feeds on human flesh. Wintry isolation and madness rule in an essential entry in the New Year’s Eve horror canon.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784577753180temp-1784577753117-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"1981\",\"runtime\":\"87\",\"language\":\"ENGLISH\",\"country\":\"Canada\",\"premiere\":\"Retrospective\",\"rating\":\"18\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Jim Makichuk\",\"cast\":\"Riva Spier, Murray Ord, Sheri McFadden, Georgia Collins\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e021\",\"name\":\"Retrospective\",\"color\":\"#ff8fdc\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.534Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:43:11.962Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T11:52:16.937Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for your order.&nbsp;Please find below your ticket. You just need to produce this on your phone where a member of our team will scan it.&nbsp;<strong>Please arrive on time – there are no trailers.&nbsp;Latecomers may be denied entry.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PLEASE NOTE:- FrightFest is a horror, fantasy, science fiction and thriller film based event for over 18s. Films shown will feature an assortment of the following: supernatural/alien threats, strong language, upsetting scenes, violence, gore, blood, rape, suicide, monstrous menace, tobacco products, creature mayhem, psychological intimidation, sexual imagery, death, child endangerment, maiming, religious profanity, abusive behaviour, bullying, nudity, drug use, strobe lighting and racial stereotyping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: This is an <strong>over 18’s</strong> event and no children are allowed entry.&nbsp;All sales are final.&nbsp;<strong>FrightFest does not refund tickets</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please ensure you have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct before attending. This can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18. ID may be required. All sales are final and no refunds are given.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a5ea71b46d929fd78f8b2d3\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"HOME BODIES\",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe West End - Discovery Screen 2\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a53dc50f89ce2f3d85a453d\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe West End - Discovery Screen 2\",\"short_name\":\"Discovery Screen 2\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"ODEON Luxe West End, 38a Leicester Square. London WC2H 7DX.\",\"default_capacity\":74,\"color\":\"#ff8fdc\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"e2b15fdc-5d76-c3e8-6bee-9835d6ec4e83\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#4176A5\",\"_id\":\"6a5977c395de359ee0fb3d1d\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#B2AFB0\",\"_id\":\"6a5977c395de359ee0fb3d1e\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Single Ticket\",\"color\":\"#F53F3F\",\"_id\":\"6a5977c395de359ee0fb3d1f\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"label\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"color\":\"#FBA700\",\"_id\":\"6a5977c395de359ee0fb3d20\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-08-29T19:35:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-29T21:27:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":72,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a5ea71b46d929fd78f8b2d6\",\"name\":\"Single Ticket\",\"price\":1499,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":46,\"quantity_sold\":46,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"3\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null},{\"id\":\"6a5fb0b1b4a27c3c651bcae9\",\"name\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":18,\"quantity_sold\":18,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"4\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[\"6a804e190a759551798b743a\",\"6a858c1b401c5b05fa64df30\"],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e06c\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"FrightFest 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5dd16a51cb714c002f548a83\",\"name\":\"HOME BODIES\",\"sort_key\":\"HOME BODIES\",\"description\":\"<p>While finishing extensive post-production on the FrightFest Hammer selection ITHAQUA, director Casey Walker (producer of THE VOID and IN A VIOLENT NATURE) helmed this intriguing miniature gem.  HOME BODIES is a Christmas  movie unlike any you’ve seen before as it follows the daily routine of two children, Red and Blue, who are being raised in isolation by an automated house. Instructed by the enigmatic voice of Papa, one Noel they find an unexpected Christmas present by the tree, a stranger named Pal. And Pal’s arrival signifies a new household dynamic as they begin to question their universal existence. </p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784577935822temp-1784577935770-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"92\",\"language\":\"ENGLISH\",\"country\":\"Canada\",\"premiere\":\"International\",\"rating\":\"18\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Casey Walker\",\"cast\":\"Ess Hödlmoser, Ian Ho, Emma Ho\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.547Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:42:27.466Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T12:12:35.781Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for your order.&nbsp;Please find below your ticket. You just need to produce this on your phone where a member of our team will scan it.&nbsp;<strong>Please arrive on time – there are no trailers.&nbsp;Latecomers may be denied entry.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PLEASE NOTE:- FrightFest is a horror, fantasy, science fiction and thriller film based event for over 18s. Films shown will feature an assortment of the following: supernatural/alien threats, strong language, upsetting scenes, violence, gore, blood, rape, suicide, monstrous menace, tobacco products, creature mayhem, psychological intimidation, sexual imagery, death, child endangerment, maiming, religious profanity, abusive behaviour, bullying, nudity, drug use, strobe lighting and racial stereotyping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: This is an <strong>over 18’s</strong> event and no children are allowed entry.&nbsp;All sales are final.&nbsp;<strong>FrightFest does not refund tickets</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please ensure you have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct before attending. This can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18. ID may be required. All sales are final and no refunds are given.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a5ea89df4ac0bac8eff483c\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"SEOUL STATION\",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Discovery Screen 3\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a53d19a120a5c364136d42b\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Discovery Screen 3\",\"short_name\":\"Discovery Screen 3\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"23-26 Leicester Square, London.  WC2H 7JY.\",\"default_capacity\":41,\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"faf60e2b-1976-4811-97c8-389557fc83d2\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#4176A5\",\"_id\":\"6a649526f9d9051f6887b481\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"Passholder Tickets\",\"color\":\"#FBA700\",\"_id\":\"6a649526f9d9051f6887b482\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Single Tickets\",\"color\":\"#F53F3F\",\"_id\":\"6a649526f9d9051f6887b483\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#B2AFB0\",\"_id\":\"6a649526f9d9051f6887b484\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-08-29T19:35:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-29T21:17:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":41,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a5ea89df4ac0bac8eff483f\",\"name\":\"Single Tickets\",\"price\":1499,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":24,\"quantity_sold\":24,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"3\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null},{\"id\":\"6a5f905b651e9cd25e9f2a52\",\"name\":\"Passholder Tickets\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":10,\"quantity_sold\":10,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"2\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[\"6a804e190a759551798b743a\",\"6a858c1b401c5b05fa64df30\"],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e096\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"FrightFest 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5dd16a51cb714c002f548a83\",\"name\":\"SEOUL STATION\",\"sort_key\":\"SEOUL STATION\",\"description\":\"<p>Go back to where it all began in the award-winning animated prequel to that made director Yeon Sang-ho famous. One day before events in that rip-roaring zombie shocker, amid busy passers-by, a homeless man with a bleeding neck-wound finds refuge in bustling Seoul Station. Ignored by everyone, the bitten vagabond slowly succumbs to his lethal trauma and dies, only to become a ravenous reanimated corpse, attacking and spreading his virulent disease. Is all hope lost? Are the walking dead the only monsters? A teenage runaway, her layabout boyfriend and desperate father will soon find out.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784579406387temp-1784579406332-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2016\",\"language\":\"South Korean\",\"country\":\"South Korea\",\"premiere\":\"UK\",\"rating\":\"18\",\"genre\":\"South Korean\",\"runtime\":\"92\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Yeon Sang-ho\",\"cast\":\"Ryu Seung-ryong, Shim Eun-kyung, Lee Joon, Lee Sang-hee.\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e021\",\"name\":\"Retrospective\",\"color\":\"#ff8fdc\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"hidden\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.602Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:39:26.039Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T12:01:06.662Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for your order.&nbsp;Please find below your ticket. You just need to produce this on your phone where a member of our team will scan it.&nbsp;<strong>Please arrive on time – there are no trailers.&nbsp;Latecomers may be denied entry.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PLEASE NOTE:- FrightFest is a horror, fantasy, science fiction and thriller film based event for over 18s. Films shown will feature an assortment of the following: supernatural/alien threats, strong language, upsetting scenes, violence, gore, blood, rape, suicide, monstrous menace, tobacco products, creature mayhem, psychological intimidation, sexual imagery, death, child endangerment, maiming, religious profanity, abusive behaviour, bullying, nudity, drug use, strobe lighting and racial stereotyping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: This is an <strong>over 18’s</strong> event and no children are allowed entry.&nbsp;All sales are final.&nbsp;<strong>FrightFest does not refund tickets</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please ensure you have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct before attending. This can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18. ID may be required. All sales are final and no refunds are given.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a5ea71046d929fd78f8b219\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"BINDING EVA\",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe West End - Discovery Screen 1\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a53d8f172ba3569f93d018c\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe West End - Discovery Screen 1\",\"short_name\":\"Discovery Screen 1\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"ODEON Luxe West End, 38a Leicester Square. London WC2H 7DX.\",\"default_capacity\":166,\"color\":\"#99c6ef\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"18b3da24-c60c-ecd9-f718-b6803037dd63\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#4176A5\",\"_id\":\"6a64966ab8d304b716d49458\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#B2AFB0\",\"_id\":\"6a64966ab8d304b716d49459\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"color\":\"#FBA700\",\"_id\":\"6a64966ab8d304b716d4945a\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"label\":\"Single Ticket\",\"color\":\"#F53F3F\",\"_id\":\"6a64966ab8d304b716d4945b\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-08-29T19:45:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-29T21:25:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":166,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a5ea71046d929fd78f8b21c\",\"name\":\"Single Ticket\",\"price\":1499,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":119,\"quantity_sold\":76,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":43,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"4\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null},{\"id\":\"6a5fb7d74105535f7280b3d6\",\"name\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":39,\"quantity_sold\":38,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":1,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"3\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[\"6a804e190a759551798b743a\",\"6a858c1b401c5b05fa64df30\"],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e02a\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"FrightFest 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5dd16a51cb714c002f548a83\",\"name\":\"BINDING EVA\",\"sort_key\":\"BINDING EVA\",\"description\":\"<p>A stunning feature debut from award-winning short film director Conscian Morgan. Deep in the Forest of Dean, Felix, a small-time criminal on the run, returns again and again to the same moment of judgement, and the same impossible choice. Because Felix’s journey is towards a shocking realisation that love and self-sacrifice are everything while discovering what it means to care beyond himself. Shot with a minimal crew for long days and nights in the mud and rain, the double bass and cello score mirrors the unsettling melancholy regarding the cost of a redemption that comes too late.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784576773816temp-1784576773758-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"76\",\"language\":\"ENGLISH\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"premiere\":\"World\",\"rating\":\"18\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Conscian Morgan\",\"cast\":\"Ryan Ralph Gerrard, Catherine Deevy, Darcey Wood\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e02c\",\"name\":\"First Blood\",\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.468Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:46:42.615Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T11:44:51.571Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for your order.&nbsp;Please find below your ticket. You just need to produce this on your phone where a member of our team will scan it.&nbsp;<strong>Please arrive on time – there are no trailers.&nbsp;Latecomers may be denied entry.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PLEASE NOTE:- FrightFest is a horror, fantasy, science fiction and thriller film based event for over 18s. Films shown will feature an assortment of the following: supernatural/alien threats, strong language, upsetting scenes, violence, gore, blood, rape, suicide, monstrous menace, tobacco products, creature mayhem, psychological intimidation, sexual imagery, death, child endangerment, maiming, religious profanity, abusive behaviour, bullying, nudity, drug use, strobe lighting and racial stereotyping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: This is an <strong>over 18’s</strong> event and no children are allowed entry.&nbsp;All sales are final.&nbsp;<strong>FrightFest does not refund tickets</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please ensure you have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct before attending. This can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18. ID may be required. All sales are final and no refunds are given.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a5ea70d46d929fd78f8b1ef\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"THE NAMELESS BALLAD\",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Single Tickets\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a53d79a6c5535dfd9936a4d\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Single Tickets\",\"short_name\":\"Main Screen - Single Tickets\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"\",\"default_capacity\":57,\"color\":\"#f22313\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"aad0d885-2851-1b2a-2d4a-7ab95f4b7deb\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#B2AFB0\",\"_id\":\"6a6e3c9a1dde808a7926d17e\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"Single Ticket\",\"color\":\"#F53F3F\",\"_id\":\"6a6e3c9a1dde808a7926d17f\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-08-29T20:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-29T21:50:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity\":57,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a5ea70d46d929fd78f8b1f2\",\"name\":\"Single Ticket\",\"price\":1499,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":57,\"quantity_sold\":58,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"2\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e0c5\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"FrightFest 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5dd16a51cb714c002f548a83\",\"name\":\"THE NAMELESS BALLAD\",\"sort_key\":\"NAMELESS BALLAD, THE\",\"description\":\"<p>Death is a powerful muse. Under pressure from his record label, a young musician in crisis takes refuge in an isolated Italian villa to find inspiration for his next album. But the discovery of an ancient piano and a forgotten diary drags him into a spiral of twisted obsessions, supernatural visions and ghostly presences that finally push him to the brink of madness. The latest genre treat from FrightFest favourite, multi-tasking entertainer Federico Zampaglione, director of SHADOW, TULPA and THE WELL. </p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784579949735temp-1784579949657-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"90\",\"language\":\"Italy\",\"country\":\"Italy\",\"premiere\":\"World\",\"rating\":\"18\",\"genre\":\"Italian\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Federico Zampaglione\",\"cast\":\"Jamie Ward, Alana Boden, Fabrizio Ferracane, Seaumas Sargent\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.673Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:36:04.115Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T10:29:59.635Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_prero