nnocence, goes to a psychic for help in CRAZY LIPS. The price asked is far more than she expected, and the answers are nothing she could ever have imagined. And what is the FBI doing investigating a murder in Japan?</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784577216112temp-1784577216034-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2000\",\"runtime\":\"83\",\"language\":\"Japanese\",\"country\":\"Japan\",\"premiere\":\"UK\",\"rating\":\"18\",\"genre\":\"Japanese\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Hirohisa Sasaki\",\"cast\":\"Hitomi Miwa, Kazuma Suzuki, Ren Ôsugi, Hiroshi Abe\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e021\",\"name\":\"Retrospective\",\"color\":\"#ff8fdc\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.491Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:45:29.337Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T11:53:25.490Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for your order.&nbsp;Please find below your ticket. You just need to produce this on your phone where a member of our team will scan it.&nbsp;<strong>Please arrive on time – there are no trailers.&nbsp;Latecomers may be denied entry.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PLEASE NOTE:- FrightFest is a horror, fantasy, science fiction and thriller film based event for over 18s. Films shown will feature an assortment of the following: supernatural/alien threats, strong language, upsetting scenes, violence, gore, blood, rape, suicide, monstrous menace, tobacco products, creature mayhem, psychological intimidation, sexual imagery, death, child endangerment, maiming, religious profanity, abusive behaviour, bullying, nudity, drug use, strobe lighting and racial stereotyping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: This is an <strong>over 18’s</strong> event and no children are allowed entry.&nbsp;All sales are final.&nbsp;<strong>FrightFest does not refund tickets</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please ensure you have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct before attending. This can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18. ID may be required. All sales are final and no refunds are given.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a5ea70e46d929fd78f8b207\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"ALIEN\",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Single Tickets\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a53d79a6c5535dfd9936a4d\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Single Tickets\",\"short_name\":\"Main Screen - Single Tickets\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"\",\"default_capacity\":57,\"color\":\"#f22313\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"aad0d885-2851-1b2a-2d4a-7ab95f4b7deb\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#B2AFB0\",\"_id\":\"6a6e3c9a1dde808a7926d17e\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"Single Ticket\",\"color\":\"#F53F3F\",\"_id\":\"6a6e3c9a1dde808a7926d17f\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-08-30T14:30:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-30T16:46:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity\":57,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a5ea70e46d929fd78f8b20a\",\"name\":\"Single Ticket\",\"price\":1499,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":57,\"quantity_sold\":60,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"2\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e01f\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"FrightFest 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5dd16a51cb714c002f548a83\",\"name\":\"ALIEN\",\"sort_key\":\"ALIEN\",\"description\":\"<p>What better way to celebrate the release of SEGA’s hugely anticipated ALIEN: ISOLATION 2 game than with a screening of Ridley Scott’s classic sci-fi shocker. This ‘haunted house in space’ horror featured top-notch acting, a star-making performance from astronaut Sigourney Weaver and Swiss Artist HR GIger’s unique and innovative bio-mechanoid creature design. Scott’s eye for detail and brilliant way of alternating false scares with genuine jolts creates a seamless blend of gothic Grand Guignol and harrowing dread. One of the all-time terrifying thrill-rides returns to the big screen where it all began back in 1979.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784762874939temp-1784762874923-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"1979\",\"runtime\":\"116\",\"language\":\"ENGLISH\",\"country\":\"USA/UK\",\"rating\":\"18\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Ridley Scott\",\"cast\":\"Sigourney Weaver, Veronica Cartwright, Harry Dean Stanton, John Hur\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e021\",\"name\":\"Retrospective\",\"color\":\"#ff8fdc\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.449Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T10:52:15.736Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-05T21:41:09.283Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for your order.&nbsp;Please find below your ticket. You just need to produce this on your phone where a member of our team will scan it.&nbsp;<strong>Please arrive on time – there are no trailers.&nbsp;Latecomers may be denied entry.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PLEASE NOTE:- FrightFest is a horror, fantasy, science fiction and thriller film based event for over 18s. Films shown will feature an assortment of the following: supernatural/alien threats, strong language, upsetting scenes, violence, gore, blood, rape, suicide, monstrous menace, tobacco products, creature mayhem, psychological intimidation, sexual imagery, death, child endangerment, maiming, religious profanity, abusive behaviour, bullying, nudity, drug use, strobe lighting and racial stereotyping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: This is an <strong>over 18’s</strong> event and no children are allowed entry.&nbsp;All sales are final.&nbsp;<strong>FrightFest does not refund tickets</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please ensure you have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct before attending. This can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18. ID may be required. All sales are final and no refunds are given.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a5ea71a46d929fd78f8b2c7\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"DO YOU WANT TO PLAY?\",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe West End - Discovery Screen 2\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a53dc50f89ce2f3d85a453d\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe West End - Discovery Screen 2\",\"short_name\":\"Discovery Screen 2\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"ODEON Luxe West End, 38a Leicester Square. London WC2H 7DX.\",\"default_capacity\":74,\"co