fight to escape the rundown psychiatric hospital before its dark past claims him forever. But when the CCTV security cameras and his own bodycam footage are finally viewed it shows unexplainable incidents that still continue to baffle investigators.41</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784578143568temp-1784578143458-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"87\",\"language\":\"ENGLISH\",\"country\":\"USA\",\"premiere\":\"UK\",\"rating\":\"18\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Nicholas Pineda\",\"cast\":\"Paul Syre Lee, Mark Anthony Williams, Danielle Kennedy, Corinna Wagner-Smith\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.557Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:41:51.985Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T11:46:56.801Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for your order.&nbsp;Please find below your ticket. You just need to produce this on your phone where a member of our team will scan it.&nbsp;<strong>Please arrive on time – there are no trailers.&nbsp;Latecomers may be denied entry.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PLEASE NOTE:- FrightFest is a horror, fantasy, science fiction and thriller film based event for over 18s. Films shown will feature an assortment of the following: supernatural/alien threats, strong language, upsetting scenes, violence, gore, blood, rape, suicide, monstrous menace, tobacco products, creature mayhem, psychological intimidation, sexual imagery, death, child endangerment, maiming, religious profanity, abusive behaviour, bullying, nudity, drug use, strobe lighting and racial stereotyping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: This is an <strong>over 18’s</strong> event and no children are allowed entry.&nbsp;All sales are final.&nbsp;<strong>FrightFest does not refund tickets</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please ensure you have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct before attending. This can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18. ID may be required. All sales are final and no refunds are given.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a5ea8a9f4ac0bac8eff48f0\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"RUBBERHEAD: THE LIFE & TIMES OF STEVE JOHNSON\",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Discovery Screen 4\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a4d7692d104ae98644c1bbc\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Discovery Screen 4\",\"short_name\":\"Discovery Screen 4\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"23-26 Leicester Square, London.  WC2H 7JY.\",\"default_capacity\":40,\"color\":\"#c8cdd0\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"6b3f0bd6-f219-b12b-c112-ce0741445a23\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#4176A5\",\"_id\":\"6a91747e38c1ba4a4427323c\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"Single Ticket\",\"color\":\"#F53F3F\",\"_id\":\"6a91747e38c1ba4a4427323d\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"color\":\"#FBA700\",\"_id\":\"6a91747e38c1ba4a4427323e\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#B2AFB0\",\"_id\":\"6a91747e38c1ba4a4427323f\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-08-30T19:45:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-30T21:44:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":40,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a5ea8a9f4ac0bac8eff48f3\",\"name\":\"Single Ticket\",\"price\":1499,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":23,\"quantity_sold\":23,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"2\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null},{\"id\":\"6a5f9fbf43263b8e2734d7fc\",\"name\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":10,\"quantity_sold\":10,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"3\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[\"6a804e190a759551798b743a\",\"6a858c3034cfd46f50cd2c00\"],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e092\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"FrightFest 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5dd16a51cb714c002f548a83\",\"name\":\"RUBBERHEAD: THE LIFE & MONSTERS OF STEVE JOHNSON\",\"sort_key\":\"RUBBERHEAD: THE LIFE & MONSTERS OF STEVE JOHNSON\",\"description\":\"<p>Known for his intense work ethic, perfectionism, and obsession with breaking new ground, Steve Johnson has created iconic creature effects for some of the most beloved horror and sci-fi movies in cinema history. A deeply personal documentary/memoir providing an educational portrait of the golden age of special effects makeup, including AN AMERICAN WEREWOLF IN LONDON, PREDATOR and GHOSTBUSTERS. Steve shares endless outrageous anecdotes about his freewheeling adventures in Hollywood, while also telling the inspirational but tragic story of his meteoric rise and subsequent fall from grace. A humorous and heartfelt portrait of one of Hollywood’s most prolific monster makers.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784763026648temp-1784763026631-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"104\",\"language\":\"ENGLISH\",\"country\":\"USA\",\"premiere\":\"European\",\"rating\":\"18\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Nick Taylor\",\"cast\":\"Steve Johnson, Linnea Quigley, Tom Holland, Rick Baker\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e05c\",\"name\":\"Documentary\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.598Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-29T19:26:39.635Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T11:54:15.452Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geograp