 Luxe Leicester Square - Discovery Screen 4\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a4d7692d104ae98644c1bbc\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Discovery Screen 4\",\"short_name\":\"Discovery Screen 4\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"23-26 Leicester Square, London.  WC2H 7JY.\",\"default_capacity\":40,\"color\":\"#c8cdd0\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"6b3f0bd6-f219-b12b-c112-ce0741445a23\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#4176A5\",\"_id\":\"6a91747e38c1ba4a4427323c\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"Single Ticket\",\"color\":\"#F53F3F\",\"_id\":\"6a91747e38c1ba4a4427323d\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"color\":\"#FBA700\",\"_id\":\"6a91747e38c1ba4a4427323e\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#B2AFB0\",\"_id\":\"6a91747e38c1ba4a4427323f\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-08-31T12:35:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-31T14:32:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":40,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a5ea8aaf4ac0bac8eff48f9\",\"name\":\"Single Ticket\",\"price\":1499,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":23,\"quantity_sold\":23,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"2\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null},{\"id\":\"6a5fa074f467aa15501ad66f\",\"name\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":10,\"quantity_sold\":10,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"3\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[\"6a804e190a759551798b743a\",\"6a858c3f365982c54a60687e\"],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e0bb\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"FrightFest 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5dd16a51cb714c002f548a83\",\"name\":\"THE FLESH ITSELF\",\"sort_key\":\"FLESH ITSELF, THE\",\"description\":\"<p>Three deserter soldiers from the South American Paraguayan War in 1870  struggle to survive as they cross a desolate border region. Stumbling upon an isolated house inhabited only by a mysterious farmer and a silent young woman, it seems like they have found a safe haven. But the place soon reveals disturbing secrets and as night falls, the desperate soldiers realize they may have escaped the horrors of war only to step into something far more sinister. A psychological horror thriller in the tradition of THE INNOCENTS, in which shadows and layers of sounds suggest alternate truths and sensual apprehension. </p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784579839308temp-1784579839200-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2025\",\"runtime\":\"97\",\"language\":\"Brazil\",\"country\":\"Brazil\",\"premiere\":\"UK\",\"rating\":\"18\",\"genre\":\"Brazillian\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Ian SBF\",\"cast\":\"Jorge Guerreiro, George Sauma, Pierri Baitelli, Jade Mascarenhas\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.657Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:36:46.284Z\",\"_use_beta_v