/conduct/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18. ID may be required. All sales are final and no refunds are given.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a5ea8a8f4ac0bac8eff48e4\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"GHOSTKEEPER\",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Discovery Screen 4\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a4d7692d104ae98644c1bbc\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Discovery Screen 4\",\"short_name\":\"Discovery Screen 4\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"23-26 Leicester Square, London.  WC2H 7JY.\",\"default_capacity\":40,\"color\":\"#c8cdd0\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"6b3f0bd6-f219-b12b-c112-ce0741445a23\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#4176A5\",\"_id\":\"6a91747e38c1ba4a4427323c\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"Single Ticket\",\"color\":\"#F53F3F\",\"_id\":\"6a91747e38c1ba4a4427323d\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"color\":\"#FBA700\",\"_id\":\"6a91747e38c1ba4a4427323e\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"label\":\"House\",\"color\":\"#B2AFB0\",\"_id\":\"6a91747e38c1ba4a4427323f\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-08-31T17:30:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-08-31T19:17:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":40,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a5ea8a8f4ac0bac8eff48e7\",\"name\":\"Single Ticket\",\"price\":1499,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":23,\"quantity_sold\":23,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"2\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null},{\"id\":\"6a5fa103d473a286c011ad4a\",\"name\":\"Passholder Ticket\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":10,\"quantity_sold\":10,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":0,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"3\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[\"6a804e190a759551798b743a\",\"6a858c3f365982c54a60687e\"],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e062\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"FrightFest 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5dd16a51cb714c002f548a83\",\"name\":\"GHOSTKEEPER\",\"sort_key\":\"GHOSTKEEPER\",\"description\":\"<p>Long-regarded as the Canadian answer to Stanley Kubrick’s THE SHINING, the  4K restoration of the Canuxploitation supernatural slasher classic based on the Wendigo legend. During a New Year’s Eve snowmobiling trip, three friends veer off the path to explore a private property. Stranded by a heavy snowfall, they stumble upon an abandoned hotel and seek refuge for the night. But before long, they meet a menacing woman who shares the building with her knife-wielding son and a mysterious creature who feeds on human flesh. Wintry isolation and madness rule in an essential entry in the New Year’s Eve horror canon.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1784577753180temp-1784577753117-cover.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"1981\",\"runtime\":\"87\",\"language\":\"ENGLISH\",\"country\":\"Canada\",\"premiere\":\"Retrospective\",\"rating\":\"18\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Jim Makichuk\",\"cast\":\"Riva Spier, Murray Ord, Sheri McFadden, Georgia Collins\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a5e1af9ae9bbda67f65e021\",\"name\":\"Retrospective\",\"color\":\"#ff8fdc\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T12:56:25.534Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T11:43:11.962Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T11:55:50.925Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p>Thank you for your order.&nbsp;Please find below your ticket. You just need to produce this on your phone where a member of our team will scan it.&nbsp;<strong>Please arrive on time – there are no trailers.&nbsp;Latecomers may be denied entry.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PLEASE NOTE:- FrightFest is a horror, fantasy, science fiction and thriller film based event for over 18s. Films shown will feature an assortment of the following: supernatural/alien threats, strong language, upsetting scenes, violence, gore, blood, rape, suicide, monstrous menace, tobacco products, creature mayhem, psychological intimidation, sexual imagery, death, child endangerment, maiming, religious profanity, abusive behaviour, bullying, nudity, drug use, strobe lighting and racial stereotyping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please Note: This is an <strong>over 18’s</strong> event and no children are allowed entry.&nbsp;All sales are final.&nbsp;<strong>FrightFest does not refund tickets</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please ensure you have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct before attending. This can be found here: <a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For any queries please contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:tickets@frightfest.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tickets@frightfest.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[],\"terms_at_checkout\":\"<p>I confirm I am over 18. ID may be required. All sales are final and no refunds are given.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I have read and agree to the FrightFest Code of Conduct.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://www.frightfest.co.uk/conduct/</a></p>\"},{\"id\":\"6a5ea70b46d929fd78f8b1b9\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a17699850d66159f2035097\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"HY3NA\",\"description\":\"\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Single Tickets\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a53d79a6c5535dfd9936a4d\",\"name\":\"ODEON Luxe Leicester Square - Single Tickets\",\"short_name\":\"Main Screen - Single Tickets\",\"description\":\"\",\"address\":\"\",\"default_capacity\":57,\"color\":\"#f22313\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"aad0d885-2851-1b2a-2d4a-7ab95f4b7d