turehouse Oxford</a></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">57 Walton Street</strong></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Oxford</strong></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">OX2 6AE</strong></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Nearest Station:</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Oxford</span></p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.picturehouses.com/cinema/phoenix-picturehouse/accessibility\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\"><strong>Access Information</strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.picturehouses.com/cinema/picturehouse-central?filter=\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\\\">Picturehouse Central</a></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Corner of Great Windmill Street and Shaftesbury Avenue</strong></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Piccadilly Circus</strong></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">London</strong></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">W1D 7DH</strong></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Nearest Station:</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Charing Cross</span></p><p><a href=\\\"https://www.picturehouses.com/cinema/picturehouse-central/accessibility\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\"><strong>Access Information</strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\\\"https://reelcinemas.co.uk/borehamwood\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\\\">Reel Cinema Borehamwood</a></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">84 Shenley Road</strong></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Borehamwood</strong></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">WD6 1EH</strong></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Nearest Station:</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Elstree &amp; Borehamwood</span></p><p><a href=\\\"https://reelcinemas.co.uk/borehamwood/accessibility\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\"><strong>Access Information</strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\\\"https://showroomcinema.org.uk/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\\\">Showroom Sheffield</a></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Paternoster Row</strong></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Sheffield City Centre</strong></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Sheffield</strong></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">S1 2BX</strong></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Nearest Station:</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Sheffield Station Hallam University</span></p><p><a href=\\\"https://showroomcinema.org.uk/accessibility\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\"><strong>Access Information</strong></a><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\"> </strong></p>\"}}]},{\"path\":\"stayintouch\",\"display_name\":\"Stay in Touch\",\"content\":{\"__html\":\"<p>We love hearing from our filmgoers, and we are making it easier and easier for you to stay in touch. Follow us and interact with us on your preferred social-media platform. See the links below...</p>\"},\"show_table\":true,\"table_header\":\"\",\"table\":[{\"description\":{\"__html\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><a href=\\\"https://www.facebook.com/UKJewishFilm/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.com/eventive-static/0287819488c7a25a06cfd8a1127f6a9e.png\\\"></a></p>\"},\"show_action_button\":true,\"action_text\":\"Facebook\",\"action_primary\":true,\"title\":\"FACEBOOK\",\"action_link\":\"https://www.facebook.com/UKJewishFilm/\"},{\"description\":{\"__html\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><a href=\\\"https://x.com/ukjewishfilm\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.com/eventive-static/7d9cabf749c94e015c30c489c87f79aa.png\\\"></a></p>\"},\"title\":\"X\",\"show_action_button\":true,\"action_text\":\"X\",\"action_primary\":true,\"action_link\":\"https://x.com/ukjewishfilm\"},{\"title\":\"INSTAGRAM\",\"description\":{\"__html\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/ukjewishfilm/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.com/eventive-static/d43e693092ce5bbedf7386985f993107.png\\\"></a></p>\"},\"show_action_button\":true,\"action_text\":\"INSTAGRAM\",\"action_link\":\"https://www.instagram.com/ukjewishfilm/\",\"action_primary\":true},{\"title\":\"TIKTOK\",\"description\":{\"__html\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><a href=\\\"https://www.tiktok.com/@ukjewishfilm\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.com/eventive-static/66dce04b68424cd5d32a7720de55b856.png\\\"></a></p>\"},\"show_action_button\":true,\"action_text\":\"TIKTOK\",\"action_link\":\"https://www.tiktok.com/@ukjewishfilm\",\"action_primary\":true},{\"title\":\"LETTERBOXD\",\"description\":{\"__html\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><a href=\\\"https://letterboxd.com/ukjewishfilm\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.com/eventive-static/245712055430a310a3ae0c54e63d3919.png\\\"></a></p>\"},\"show_action_button\":true,\"action_text\":\"LETTERBOXD\",\"action_link\":\"https://letterboxd.com/ukjewishfilm\",\"action_primary\":true},{\"title\":\"EMAIL\",\"description\":{\"__html\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><a href=\\\"mailto:info@ukjewishfilm.org\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.com/eventive-static/835ec09e6c213da54ef4ccbf4cb61143.png\\\"></a></p>\"},\"show_action_button\":true,\"action_text\":\"EMAIL US\",\"action_link\":\"mailto:info@ukjewishfilm.org\",\"action_primary\":true}],\"post_table_content\":{\"__html\":\"<p><br></p>\"}},{\"display_name\":\"Subtitled Screenings\",\"path\":\"subtitled-screenings\",\"show_table\":true,\"table_header\":\"\",\"table\":[{\"title\":\"Film\"},{\"title\":\"Date\"},{\"title\":\"Venue\"}],\"content\":{\"__html\":\"<p>These screenings include films with English subtitles playing throughout the whole film: </p><p><br></p>\"},\"hide_in_menu\":true},{\"path\":\"closed-captioned-screenings\",\"display_name\":\"Closed Captioned Screenings\",\"content\":{\"__html\":\"<p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">These film screenings offer HoH (Hard of Hearing) subtitles, including descriptions of non-dialogue audio, for the D/deaf or hard of hearing.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">﻿HoH substitles are available to all those attending the cinema screenings of these films. For online screenings, HoH subtitles can be toggled on or off. </span></p><p><br></p>\"},\"show_table\":true,\"table\":[{\"title\":\"Film\"},{\"title\":\"Date\"},{\"title\":\"Venue\"}],\"hide_in_menu\":true},{\"path\":\"relaxed-screenings\",\"display_name\":\"Relaxed Screenings\",\"show_table\":true,\"table\":[{\"title\":\"FILM\"},{\"title\":\"DATE\"},{\"title\":\"VENUE\"}],\"content\":{\"__html\":\"<p>Our relaxed screenings are designed to create a more comfortable and welcoming cinema-going experience for those who may need additional support.</p><p><br></p><p>During these screenings, the cinema lights remain on at a low level and the volume is turned down. You're welcome to move around, leave the auditorium, or take a break from the film whenever you need to.</p><p><br></p><p>Please contact the box office if you have any questions or would like further information.</p>\"},\"hide_in_menu\":true},{\"path\":\"wheelchair-accessible-screenings\",\"display_name\":\"Wheelchair Accessible Screenings\",\"content\":{\"__html\":\"<p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\\\">Listed are all the screenings with spaces for wheelchair users and their companions, as well as cinemas with step free access seats. Please contact the UK Jewish Film box office to book these spaces at 02031760048. If you are interested in a screening that is not listed please contact the cinema (details in the venue access page). </span></p>\"},\"show_table\":true,\"table\":[{\"title\":\"Film\"},{\"title\":\"date\"},{\"title\":\"venue\"}],\"hide_in_menu\":true}],\"include_welcome_page\":true,\"use_film_guide_as_main_page\":false,\"welcome_custom_header\":true,\"welcome_header\":\"Welcome to the UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"welcome_show_splash_banner\":true,\"passes_show_splash_banner\":true,\"memberships_show_splash_banner\":false,\"always_show_splash_banner\":true,\"welcome_splash_banner_image\":\"\",\"welcome_hide_title\":false,\"welcome_show_buttons\":true,\"welcome_show_schedule_button\":false,\"welcome_schedule_button_title\":\"FESTIVAL SCHEDULE\",\"welcome_show_film_guide_button\":true,\"welcome_other_buttons\":[{\"label\":\"FESTIVAL SCHEDULE\",\"link\":\"/schedule\",\"new_tab\":true,\"primary\":true},{\"label\":\"ONLINE FESTIVAL\",\"link\":\"https://watch.eventive.org/ukjewishfilmfestival2026\",\"new_tab\":true,\"primary\":true},{\"label\":\"UK JEWISH FILM WEBSITE\",\"link\":\"https://ukjewishfilm.org\",\"new_tab\":true,\"primary\":true},{\"label\":\"PURCHASE ONLINE FESTIVAL PASS\",\"link\":\"passes/buy\",\"primary\":true},{\"label\":\"MANAGE YOUR ACCOUNT\",\"link\":\"https://ukjewishfilmfestival2026.eventive.org/account\",\"new_tab\":false,\"primary\":true}],\"welcome_show_plaintext_message\":false,\"welcome_message\":\"\",\"welcome_message_schedule_live\":\"\",\"welcome_message_teaser\":\"\",\"welcome_intro_content\":{\"__html\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">Welcome to the ticket-booking website for the 30th edition of the UK Jewish Film Festival,</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">bringing you the best in Jewish cinema from around the globe.</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">To see the full list of exciting films we will be bringing you this year, click the <strong>FILM GUIDE</strong> button above.</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">For details of all of our Festival cinema screenings, click the <strong>FESTIVAL SCHEDULE</strong> button.</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p><h2 class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">Don't forget our Online Festival!</h2><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">Feature films and shorts, streamed directly to your preferred device. The Online Festival films are available to watch at home between the 18th and the 30th of November. This year, we are delighted to bring you a selection of the best Festival films from the past 30 years, as well as our free regular programmes of short films. For more information, click the <strong>ONLINE FESTIVAL</strong> button.</p>\"},\"welcome_show_ways_to_see\":false,\"welcome_ways_to_see_header\":\"!count! Ways to See the Festival\",\"welcome_ways_to_see\":[{\"title\":\"Method 1\",\"description\":{\"__html\":\"<div>Go ahead, edit me!</div>\"},\"action_text\":\"Learn more & buy\",\"action_link\":\"passes/buy\",\"action_primary\":true},{\"title\":\"Method 2\",\"description\":{\"__html\":\"<div>Go ahead, edit me too!</div>\"},\"action_text\":\"Browse the schedule\",\"action_link\":\"schedule\",\"action_primary\":false}],\"welcome_way_to_see_show_second_row\":false,\"welcome_ways_to_see_second_row\":[{\"title\":\"Additional Item 1\",\"description\":{\"__html\":\"<div>Go ahead, edit me!</div>\"},\"action_text\":\"Learn more & buy\",\"action_link\":\"passes/buy\",\"action_primary\":true},{\"title\":\"Additional Item 2\",\"description\":{\"__html\":\"<div>Go ahead, edit me too!</div>\"},\"action_text\":\"Browse the schedule\",\"action_link\":\"schedule\",\"action_primary\":false}],\"welcome_ways_to_see_footer\":{\"__html\":\"\"},\"welcome_ways_to_see_fixed_buttons\":true,\"welcome_custom\":{\"__html\":\"\"},\"welcome_intro_content_app\":{\"__html\":\"\"},\"welcome_custom_app\":{\"__html\":\"\"},\"schedule_default_view_mode\":\"cover\",\"schedule_default_mobile_view_mode\":\"cover\",\"schedule_unreleased_custom\":{\"__html\":\"\"},\"schedule_custom\":{\"__html\":\"\"},\"schedule_dominant_tag\":\"venue\",\"schedule_invert_colors\":false,\"schedule_group_events_by\":\"day\",\"film_guide_unreleased_custom\":{\"__html\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">The film guide has not yet been released. Check back soon!</p>\"},\"film_guide_custom\":{\"__html\":\"\"},\"film_guide_always_show_titles\":true,\"film_guide_hide_poster\":true,\"film_alternate_display_mode\":true,\"film_guide_stills_mode\":false,\"film_guide_enable_display_sections\":false,\"film_guide_selected_display_sections\":[],\"order_tickets_button\":\"Order tickets\",\"order_tickets_free_button\":\"\",\"order_more_tickets_button\":\"Order more\",\"order_button_show_rsvp_label\":false,\"order_button_rsvp_label\":\"RSVP required\",\"event_sold_out_button_label\":\"COMING SOON\",\"event_sold_out_message\":{\"__html\":\"Sorry, this event is sold out.\"},\"ticket_sales_pass_advert\":\"\",\"ticket_sales_membership_advert\":\"\",\"standalone_ticket_sales_disabled_error\":{\"__html\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>Tickets for this screening are only available to UK Jewish Film members.</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong><span class=\\\"ql-cursor\\\">﻿</span>To become a member, please visit </strong><a href=\\\"https://www.ukjewishfilm.org/members\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><strong>ukjewishfilm.org/members</strong></a></p>\"},\"standalone_ticket_sales_disabled_error_show_passes_button\":false,\"standalone_ticket_sales_disabled_error_show_memberships_button\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_disabled_error_passes_button_text\":\"\",\"standalone_ticket_sales_disabled_error_memberships_button_text\":\"\",\"standalone_ticket_sales_locked_error\":{\"__html\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">Sorry, standalone ticket sales are currently disabled. If you know the password, you can unlock them.</p>\"},\"add_event_banner_padding\":false,\"show_event_full_page_background\":true,\"event_footer\":{\"__html\":\"\"},\"standalone_tickets_checkout_message\":{\"__html\":\"\"},\"order_tickets_success\":{\"__html\":\"<p>Check your emails: a downloadable copy of these tickets is waiting for you. You do not need to print your tickets—you can simply show them on your smartphone or other screen device, when you arrive at the venue. (But feel free to print them if you prefer.)</p><p><br></p><p>You can access your tickets at any time in the web interface simply by clicking \\\"My Tickets\\\" in the upper righthand corner (the icon that looks like a little tickets stub).</p><p><br></p><p>You can either show the ticket(s) that you have had emailed to you, or you can visit this site on your smartphone at the venue and present your tickets electronically!</p>\"},\"physical_ticket_transfer_dialog_message\":{\"__html\":\"<p><strong>Only some tickets can be transferred automatically.</strong> Passholder tickets are generally not transferable. If you do not see a ticket listed, contact the event organizer for more information.</p>\"},\"physical_ticket_cancellation_dialog_message\":{\"__html\":\"<p><strong>Only some free tickets ordered using some types of passes can be canceled automatically.</strong> To request a refund or to cancel any other tickets, you must contact the event organizer directly.</p>\"},\"no_applicable_ticket_buckets_error\":{\"__html\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">Sorry, no standalone ticket types are available for this event.</p>\"},\"tickets_show_order_more_button\":true,\"hide_ticket_term_in_order_button\":false,\"my_tickets_description\":\"These are all of your purchased tickets. Open this page on your smartphone, and at the door tap the \\\"Show Barcode\\\" button and show your phone screen to the attendant. Prefer paper? Print the PDF attached to the order confirmation email, or click one of the gears below and select \\\"Download tickets PDF\\\". If purchasing multiple tickets, be sure to print or show each unique ticket barcode.\",\"passes_enabled\":true,\"pass_icons\":{},\"pass_sales_sections\":[{\"title\":\"ONLINE FESTIVAL PASS\",\"passes\":[\"online_festival_pass_2026\"],\"introduction\":{\"__html\":\"<p>At UK Jewish Film we are always trying to find ways make our films and festivals more accessible to the widest range of people possible. One of the ways we do this is by providing higher volumes of tickets at lower prices.</p><p><br></p><p>This year, we are once again offering our Online Festival Pass, which gives the holder unlimited access to all of the content in this year's online festival. </p><p><br></p><p>For this year's special 30th Edition celebration, we are delighted to be offering a selection of ten of the best films from the last three decades of the UK Jewish Film Festival.</p><p><br></p><p>Individually, feature films cost £12.00 to watch online, so if you are planning to watch three or more, an Online Festival Pass is already saving you money!</p><p><br></p><p>Once you have purchased your Online Festival Pass, the discounts will automatically be added to your account with us, and you can unlock as many of the online feature films as you like, at no extra charge.</p><p><br></p><p>You can purchase your Online Festival Pass right now, by clicking the button below.</p>\"}}],\"pass_sales_fixed_buttons\":true,\"pass_sales_details\":{\"online_festival_pass_2021\":{\"buy_label\":\"Access all online screenings for {{price}}\",\"title\":\"Online Festival Pass\"},\"18_to_30s_online_festival_pass_2021\":{\"buy_label\":\"Access all online screenings for £19.99\",\"title\":\"18 to 30s Online Festival Pass\"},\"online_festival_pass_2022\":{\"buy_label\":\"Buy ({{price}})\"},\"online_festival_pass_2023\":{\"buy_label\":\"\"},\"online_festival_pass_2024\":{\"description\":{\"__html\":\"<p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">For a one-off fee of just £45 (£36 for UK Jewish Film members), you can watch all of the films available in our online festival.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Take a look at our</span><a href=\\\"https://watch.eventive.org/ukjewishfilmfestival2024\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\"><strong> online festival guide </strong></a><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">for our selection of online films this year.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Remember to reserve your place in advance for your chosen online screenings as online films can (and do) sell out.&nbsp;All online screenings have maximum audience capacities due to film license arrangements.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Online screenings become available to watch from the start of Wednesday 20th November to the end of Thursday 28th November. Once you begin watching your purchased film, you have a period of 72 hours to complete your viewing. Viewing is permitted from within the UK only.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Looking to purchase tickets for individual online screenings? Simply browse our </strong><a href=\\\"https://watch.eventive.org/ukjewishfilmfestival2024\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\"><strong>online festival guide</strong></a><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">, select your film showing, and purchase!</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">See </strong><a href=\\\"https://ukjewishfilmfestival2024.eventive.org/ways-to-watch\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\"><strong>ways to watch</strong></a><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\"> for more information about this year's online festival.</strong></p>\"}},\"london_bundle\":{\"description\":{\"__html\":\"<p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\\\" class=\\\"ql-size-huge\\\">NOTE: THE LONDON IN-PERSON FESTIVAL HAS NOW FINISHED FOR THE YEAR. THE LONDON BUNDLE IS NO LONGER AVAILABLE.</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">.</span></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">With a London Bundle you can purchase up to ten tickets for any of the in-person screenings that make up our London Festival, with the exception of screenings at Curzon Cinemas.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">You need to purchase your bundle before buying any tickets for the festival. Tickets purchased separately, or in advance of purchasing a bundle cannot be added to a bundle retrospectively.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">You cannot use this bundle in conjunction with any other offers or discounts.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">The London Bundle costs £144.00, which is a 10% discount on the usual price of ten £16.00 tickets. Effectively, that is one ticket free, when purchasing 9 at full price!</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Tickets purchased using the bundle are not refundable UNDER ANY CIRCUMSTANCES.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">There will be no partial refunds on the cost of your bundle for any unused tickets in your bundle at the end of the Festival.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Tickets for some of our screenings cost less than £16.00. Although you can use your bundle to purchase tickets for these events, there will be no dispensation made for any difference in price. There will still only be ten tickets available per bundle, regardless of the total cost of the tickets you select.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">You do not need to purchase all of the tickets in your bundle at the same time. As long as you are logged in to our Eventive booking site, using the log-in details that are attached to your bundle, the system will automatically recognise you as a bundle holder, and will add any available and valid tickets to your bundle, without charging you for them.</span></p>\"}}},\"pass_sales_details--default\":{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":{\"__html\":\"\"},\"quantity\":1,\"buy_label\":\"Buy ({{price}})\"},\"pass_sales_details--no_passes\":{\"name\":\"None available\",\"description\":{\"__html\":\"<p>This event doesn't have any passes publicly for sale.</p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 1em;\\\">If you're the creator of this event bucket, use the admin interface to create a new pass bucket. Then use the Passes tab in the Eventive Configurator to display it on the website. You can also use the Configurator to hide this page and the \\\"Buy Passes\\\" button altogether.</p>\"},\"buy_label\":\"\"},\"my_passes_no_passes\":\"You don't have any {{passes}}.\",\"my_passes_description\":\"These are all the passes tied to your account. If you have an Online Festival Pass, use our {{link|https://watch.eventive.org/ukjewishfilmfestival2024|online festival schedule}} to reserve tickets. You can access your tickets via {{my_tickets_link|\\\"My Tickets\\\"}} or via the PDFs attached to each ticket order confirmation email. {{buy_pass_link|Looking to buy more passes?}}\",\"my_passes_footer\":{\"__html\":\"\"},\"order_passes_success\":{\"__html\":\"<p>Your order has been completed successfully. Now, reserve your place for your chosen online screenings using the film schedule, click \\\"Order Tickets\\\" and then select the pass you'd like to use to complete the order. Enjoy the Festival!</p>\"},\"pass_not_applicable_error_message\":\"This pass does not apply to this event.\",\"pass_no_web_orders_error_message\":\"This pass does not require web reservations.\",\"pass_show_buy_additional_tickets_option\":true,\"memberships_enabled\":false,\"membership_icons\":{},\"membership_sales_sections\":[{\"title\":\"Memberships\",\"memberships\":[],\"introduction\":{\"__html\":\"\"},\"introduction_highlight\":false,\"notice\":{\"__html\":\"\"},\"notice_highlight\":false}],\"membership_sales_fixed_buttons\":true,\"membership_sales_details\":{},\"membership_sales_details--default\":{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":{\"__html\":\"\"},\"quantity\":1,\"buy_label\":\"Buy ({{price}})\"},\"membership_sales_details--no_memberships\":{\"name\":\"None available\",\"description\":{\"__html\":\"<p>This event doesn't have any memberships publicly for sale.</p><p style=\\\"margin-top: 1em;\\\">If you're the creator of this event bucket, use the admin interface to create a new membership. Then use the Memberships tab in the Eventive Configurator to display it on the website. You can also use the Configurator to hide this page and the \\\"Buy Memberships\\\" button altogether.</p>\"},\"buy_label\":\"\"},\"my_memberships_no_memberships\":\"You don't have any {{memberships}}.\",\"my_memberships_description\":\"These are all the memberships tied to your account. Now, use our online schedule to reserve tickets. You can access your tickets via {{my_tickets_link|\\\"My Tickets\\\"}} or via the PDFs attached to each ticket order confirmation email. {{buy_membership_link|Looking to buy more memberships?}}\",\"my_memberships_footer\":{\"__html\":\"\"},\"order_memberships_success\":{\"__html\":\"Your order has been completed successfully. Now, reserve your tickets: from the schedule, click \\\"Order Tickets\\\" and then select the membership you'd like to use to complete the order. Enjoy your event!\"},\"membership_not_applicable_error_message\":\"This membership does not apply to this event.\",\"membership_no_web_orders_error_message\":\"This membership does not require web reservations.\",\"membership_show_buy_additional_tickets_option\":true,\"donate_inline_order_prompt\":true,\"donate_inline_order_prompt_for_passholder_orders\":false,\"donate_inline_order_prompt_for_membershipholder_orders\":false,\"donate_inline_order_title\":\"Donation to {{name}}\",\"donate_inline_order_message\":\"Opt In for Gift Aid\",\"donate_inline_levels\":[{\"amount\":1000},{\"amount\":2500},{\"amount\":5000}],\"donate_page_title\":\"Donate\",\"donate_page_content\":{\"__html\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><span class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\">Please support UK Jewish Film by making a donation.</span></p>\"},\"donate_page_levels\":[{\"amount\":500},{\"amount\":1000},{\"amount\":2500},{\"amount\":5000}],\"donate_show_other\":true,\"donation_success\":{\"__html\":\"<p>Your donation has been received. Thank you for your generous support.</p>\"},\"order_confirmation_donation_message\":\"\",\"donate_require_mailing_address\":false,\"donate_one_time_interstitial\":true,\"donate_one_time_interstitial_header\":\"One more thing...\",\"donate_one_time_interstitial_message\":{\"__html\":\"<p>Please consider adding an optional donation to support UK Jewish Film (we won't ask again).</p>\"},\"social_media\":{\"twitter\":\"\",\"facebook\":\"\",\"instagram\":\"\",\"youtube\":\"\"},\"tickets_pdf_message\":{\"__html\":\"<p>Please be sure to arrive in good time for your screening: we'd hate for you to miss the start of your film.</p><p><br></p><p>UK Jewish Film does not give refunds.</p>\"},\"favicon_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"favicon\":\"\",\"menu_show_schedule\":true,\"menu_show_film_guide\":true,\"menu_show_my_tickets\":true,\"left_nav_menu_items\":[{\"label\":\"UK Jewish Film Website\",\"link\":\"https://ukjewishfilm.org\"},{\"label\":\"Download Interactive Programme PDF\",\"link\":\"http://ukjewishfilm.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/UKJFF26_InteractiveProgramme.pdf\"}],\"global_pass_discount_enabled\":false,\"global_pass_discount_origin_event_bucket\":\"\",\"global_pass_discount_origin_pass_buckets\":[],\"global_pass_discount_coupon\":\"\",\"global_pass_discount_cta\":\"Members, {{apply_discount_link|click here}} to receive 20% off your festival pass. Not a member? {{link|https://google.com|Join today!}}\",\"global_pass_discount_applied_message\":\"Good news! The member discount will automatically be applied to your order.\",\"global_membership_discount_enabled\":false,\"global_membership_discount_origin_event_bucket\":\"\",\"global_membership_discount_origin_pass_buckets\":[],\"global_membership_discount_coupon\":\"\",\"global_membership_discount_cta\":\"Members, {{apply_discount_link|click here}} to receive 20% off your festival membership. Not a member? {{link|https://google.com|Join today!}}\",\"global_membership_discount_applied_message\":\"Good news! The member discount will automatically be applied to your order.\",\"credits_header\":\"Top-Up Your Credits\",\"credits_information\":{\"__html\":\"<p>Buy credits to use for any screening. Multiple credits may be used for the same film.</p>\"},\"credits_not_allowed\":{\"__html\":\"<p>Only members are allowed to purchase credits.</p>\"},\"credits_not_allowed_pass_button_text\":\"Become a member\",\"credits_not_allowed_membership_button_text\":\"Become a member\",\"additional_scripts\":{\"__html\":\"<!-- Facebook Pixel Code -->\\n<script>\\n  !function(f,b,e,v,n,t,s)\\n  {if(f.fbq)return;n=f.fbq=function(){n.callMethod?\\n  n.callMethod.apply(n,arguments):n.queue.push(arguments)};\\n  if(!f._fbq)f._fbq=n;n.push=n;n.loaded=!0;n.version='2.0';\\n  n.queue=[];t=b.createElement(e);t.async=!0;\\n  t.src=v;s=b.getElementsByTagName(e)[0];\\n  s.parentNode.insertBefore(t,s)}(window, document,'script',\\n  'https://connect.facebook.net/en_US/fbevents.js');\\n  fbq('init', '3072114649777676');\\n  fbq('track', 'PageView');\\n</script>\\n<noscript><img height=\\\"1\\\" width=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"display:none\\\"\\n  src=\\\"https://www.facebook.com/tr?id=3072114649777676&ev=PageView&noscript=1\\\"\\n/></noscript>\\n<!-- End Facebook Pixel Code -->\\n<!-- Global site tag (gtag.js) - Google Analytics -->\\n<script async src=\\\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=UA-25755676-1\\\"></script>\\n<script>\\n  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\\n  function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}\\n  gtag('js', new Date());\\n\\n  gtag('config', 'UA-25755676-1');\\n</script>\\n\\n<style>\\na {\\n  color: #dc3a2f !important;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  text-decoration: none;\\n}\\na:hover, a:focus {\\n  color: #eaad52 !important;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  text-decoration: underline;\\n  }\\nspan.ql-size-large {\\n    color: #eb4d6e !important\\n    font-weight: bold;\\n}\\nh1 {\\n  color: #983D71;\\n  line-height: 48px;\\n  }\\nh2 {\\n  color: #983D71;\\n  line-height: auto;\\n  }\\ndiv.tenant-injected-html h2 {\\n  color: #DF536A;\\n  line-height: auto;\\n  }\\nh3 {\\n  color: #DEA259;\\n  margin: 0px 0px 10px 0px !important;\\n  line-height: auto;\\n}\\nh4 {\\n  color: #DF4A3A;\\n  }\\nh5 {\\n  color: #DDAFC6;\\n  font-size: 12px;\\n  }\\nh6 {\\n  color: #854086;\\n  font-size: 20px;\\n  line-height: 22px;\\n  }\\n div.parallax-front h1 {\\n  color: #fff;\\n  }\\nhr {\\n  background-color: #DDAFC6;\\n  border: none; \\n  height: 2px; \\n  margin-top: 10px;\\n  margin-bottom: 30px;\\n  }\\n\\ndiv.tenant-injected-html {\\n  padding-bottom: 20px; /* Optional: leaves room for the border */\\n  border-bottom: 2px solid #DDAFC6;\\n}\\n\\ndiv.Eventive--CustomPage--Stay_in_Touch div.tenant-injected-html {\\n  border: 0;\\n  padding-bottom: 5px;\\n  }\\ndiv.Eventive--CustomPage--Venue_Access div.tenant-injected-html {\\n  border: 0;\\n  padding-bottom: 5px;\\n  }\\ndiv.Eventive--FilmCard div.tenant-injected-html {\\n  border: 0;\\n  padding-bottom: 5px;\\n  }\\ndiv.Eventive--CustomPage--Stay_in_Touch div.tenant-injected-html, div.Eventive--CustomPage--Accessibility_ div.tenant-injected-html {\\n  border: 0 !important\\n  \\n  }\\n\\n</style>\"},\"order_completion_scripts\":{\"__html\":\"  <script>\\n    fbq('track', 'Purchase', {currency: \\\"GBP\\\", value: PURCHASE_PRICE});\\n  </script>\\n  <script>\\n    gtag('event', 'purchase', {\\n  \\\"transaction_id\\\": ORDER_ID,\\n  \\\"value\\\": PURCHASE_PRICE,\\n    });\\n  </script>\"},\"head_scripts\":{\"__html\":\"\"},\"box_office_only_message\":{\"__html\":\"<p><strong>This event is not on sale yet.</strong></p><p>Tickets will be available on the 24th September for UK Jewish Film Members,</p><p>and on the 29th September to the general public.</p><p>To become a Member of UK Jewish Film, and receive exclusive early access to booking tickets for the Festival, plus a 20% discount on most Festival tickets, visit the <a href=\\\"https://ukjewishfilm.org/members/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">members' page on the UK Jewish Film website</a>.</p>\"},\"google_enable_customer_reviews\":false,\"google_merchant_id\":{},\"tag_colors\":[\"#FFFD67\",\"#CEF2EC\",\"#FF8FDC\",\"#8D95FF\",\"#608EA4\",\"#FFFC36\",\"#7FFF36\",\"#3697FF\"],\"custom_tag_colors\":{},\"sms_tickets_enabled\":true,\"hide_currency_country_prefix\":false,\"charity_donation_email_receipt\":true,\"charity_description_text\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"charity_location\":\"\",\"charity_signature\":\"\",\"charity_is_canadian\":false,\"charity_receipt_threshold\":0,\"ballot_header\":{\"__html\":\"\"},\"font_proxima_nova\":false,\"custom_statement_descriptor\":\"\",\"marquee_enabled\":false,\"custom_reply_to_email\":\"tickets@ukjewishfilm.org\",\"custom_reply_to_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"custom_main_site_url\":\"\",\"virtual_festival_back_label\":\"Main Festival Page\",\"virtual_festival_back_url\":\"https://ukjewishfilmfestival2026.eventive.org\",\"virtual_festival_catalog_label\":\"Full Catalogue \",\"virtual_festival_catalog_lead\":\"Welcome to the {{name}}.\",\"virtual_festival_catalog_body\":\"Explore our selection of online films here. Viewing is permitted from within the UK only.\",\"virtual_festival_show_livestreams_page\":false,\"virtual_festival_livestreams_label\":\"Live Streams\",\"virtual_festival_livestreams_body\":\"Here's what's coming up soon. Can't make it? No sweat. Many live streams will be available for on-demand viewing as well.\",\"virtual_festival_show_catalog_page\":true,\"virtual_festival_show_search_page\":true,\"virtual_festival_header_logo\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/42af7cfe7a66bbb4fa0f12f1758bea96.jpeg\",\"virtual_festival_header_full_width\":true,\"virtual_festival_content_creator_invite_message\":\"\",\"virtual_festival_show_donate_prompt\":true,\"virtual_festival_donate_message\":\"Support {{name}}.\",\"virtual_festival_color_palette\":\"black\",\"virtual_festival_hide_eventive_logo\":false,\"virtual_festival_eventive_logo_replacement\":\"\",\"virtual_festival_hide_tab_on_main_site\":true,\"virtual_festival_custom_preorder\":false,\"virtual_festival_preorder_text\":\"Pre-order now\",\"virtual_festival_preorder_sold_out_text\":\"Pre-orders sold out\",\"virtual_festival_custom_balloting\":false,\"virtual_festival_custom_balloting_intro\":\"This virtual screening is eligible for audience awards!\",\"virtual_festival_custom_balloting_film_not_eligible\":\"You're eligible to vote, but this particular film isn't balloted. Try selecting another film in the program.\",\"virtual_festival_custom_balloting_unlocked_instruction\":\"Watch it and then cast your vote here.\",\"virtual_festival_custom_balloting_instruction\":\"Unlock it to cast your vote.\",\"virtual_festival_custom_balloting_vote_instruction\":\"Cast your vote on this film for our audience awards.\",\"virtual_festival_custom_balloting_closed\":\"The voting period has closed. Stay tuned for the results!\",\"virtual_festival_custom_balloting_pick_your_favorite_vote_instruction\":\"This screening is balloted. Cast your vote for your favorite film in the program.\",\"virtual_festival_custom_order_confirmation\":true,\"virtual_festival_order_confirmation_preorder_message\":\"<p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Thank you! Your booking has been confirmed for your chosen online film.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Please retain this email as it contains important information about how to access your online festival screening.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Your online screening can be enjoyed via our secure streaming platform: </span><a href=\\\"watch.eventive.org/ukjewishfilmyearround\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">watch.eventive.org/ukjewishfilmyearround</a><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">. </span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">You will receive an email reminder when your screenings have been released and are available to view. Your screenings will appear in the </span><a href=\\\"https://ukjewishfilmfestivalyearround.eventive.org/tickets\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">My Tickets</a><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\"> section. Click ‘watch now’ and you will be taken to the online viewing platform. Press play and enjoy!</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">From this platform, you can view the latest complete programme including film times, expanded synopses, trailers and interviews, panel discussions and other special events. You can also manage your schedule of upcoming online festival screenings.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\"><u>How to watch</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">The online festival can be enjoyed through your home, TV, laptop or tablet. We advise that in advance of the festival you read the FAQs and technical information regarding compatible online streaming devices and how to connect smoothly. Visit: </span><a href=\\\"https://watch.eventive.org/help\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">watch.eventive.org/help</a><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Films are geo-blocked and viewing is permitted from the UK only. Visit the Ways to Watch page: </span><a href=\\\"https://watch.eventive.org/ukjewishfilmyearround\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https://watch.eventive.org/ukjewishfilmyearround</a><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">Should you have any technical issues please visit our Technical Support and FAQs page at </span><a href=\\\"https://watch.eventive.org/help\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">watch.eventive.org/help</a><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\"> or contact us at </span><a href=\\\"info@ukjewishfilm.org\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">info@ukjewishfilm.org</a><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\"> or 020 3176 0048.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">UK Jewish Film does not provide refunds. You can view our full T&amp;Cs by visiting: </span><a href=\\\"ukjewishfilm.eventive.org\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">ukjewishfilm.eventive.org</a><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\\\">We hope you enjoy the Festival.</span></p>\",\"virtual_festival_order_confirmation_unlock_message\":\"\",\"virtual_festival_tab_label\":\"WATCH ONLINE\",\"virtual_festival_show_mailing_list_opt_in\":true,\"virtual_festival_mailing_list_opt_in_message\":\"<p>Subscribe to our newsletter for updates.</p>\",\"virtual_festival_catalog_footer_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/6c986ceb6a0e2e70dda3ba853a33004a.jpeg\",\"virtual_festival_screening_footer_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/2dbe3b18e2fc2bccbe12f8978a08b685.jpeg\",\"virtual_festival_google_analytics_id\":\"UA-25755676-1\",\"virtual_festival_facebook_pixel_id\":\"3072114649777676\",\"virtual_festival_custom_css\":\"\",\"virtual_festival_full_white_label\":false,\"virtual_festival_disable_facebook_login\":false,\"virtual_festival_standalone_ticket_sales_disabled_error\":{\"__html\":\"<p>Sorry, this screening is not currently available for standalone unlocks.</p>\"},\"virtual_festival_donate_inline_levels\":[{\"amount\":500},{\"amount\":1000},{\"amount\":2500},{\"amount\":5000}],\"pass_import_use_migration_verbiage\":false,\"membership_import_use_migration_verbiage\":false,\"email_footer_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/dde7412c5279c0e8902d10ccf08e52f5.png\",\"custom_watch_domain\":\"\",\"virtual_festival_display_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Online Festival 2026\",\"virtual_festival_show_in_directory\":false,\"virtual_festival_image\":\"\",\"virtual_festival_discovery_type\":\"\",\"virtual_festival_discovery_short_description\":\"\",\"virtual_festival_discovery_tags\":[],\"virtual_festival_discovery_geographic_regions\":false,\"virtual_festival_discovery_dates\":false,\"gift_cards_enabled\":false,\"gift_cards_frontend_enabled\":false,\"gift_cards_page_title\":\"Gift Cards\",\"gift_cards_page_content\":{\"__html\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><span class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\">Make gift card purchases or check the balance of an existing gift card.</span></p>\"},\"gift_cards_purchase_levels\":[{\"amount\":2000},{\"amount\":5000},{\"amount\":10000},{\"amount\":25000}],\"gift_cards_show_other\":true,\"gift_cards_success\":{\"__html\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><span class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\">Thank you for purchasing a gift card.</span></p>\"},\"physical_show_mailing_list_opt_in\":true,\"physical_mailing_list_opt_in_message\":\"<p>Sign up to our newsletter for exciting updates. </p>\",\"virtual_festival_show_pass_sales\":true,\"virtual_festival_pass_sales_label\":\"Memberships\",\"order_confirmation_tickets_message\":\"<p><strong>Please retain this email as your booking confirmation. Details of your booking can be found at the bottom of this email.</strong></p><p><strong>Your ticket(s) is attached.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Security Information</u></strong></p><p>Please be aware that members of our security team will be present at every screening. Bag searches will be in operation, so please allow a little extra time for entering the venue. Your patience and cooperation are appreciated.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Access</u></strong></p><p>We are proud to work with venues and film distributors that provide increased accessibility options. For information on access facilities and measures in place to keep you safe at each of our partner cinema venues, including step-free access, wheelchair access and hearing loops, please visit the specific venue's website.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Should you have any queries, please contact us at <a href=\\\"mailto:info@ukjewishfilm.org\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">info@ukjewishfilm.org</a> or on 020 3176 0048.</p><p><br></p><p>UK Jewish Film does not provide refunds.</p><p><br></p><p>We hope you enjoy the screening!</p>\",\"order_confirmation_passes_message\":\"\",\"virtual_pass_sales_sections\":[],\"virtual_pass_sales_details\":{\"london_bundle\":{\"description\":{\"__html\":\"<p>asdf</p>\"}}},\"films_url_pathname\":\"films\",\"showing_url_pathname\":\"showings\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"owner\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"locale\":\"en-US\",\"api_key\":\"6b312cca0970c19b9d02e714729c7234\",\"fee\":{\"z