ion Seat (call 020 3761 0048 to book)\",\"color\":\"#49A3BA\",\"_id\":\"6abbdad92d3a1d63d6ba89d0\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"label\":\"Set Aside\",\"color\":\"#878787\",\"_id\":\"6abbdad92d3a1d63d6ba89d1\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-11-07T20:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-11-07T22:00:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":false,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity\":0,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a99a207df227dc448e97792\",\"name\":\"Adult Standard\",\"price\":1700,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity_sold\":17,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":9007199254740991,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"1\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null},{\"id\":\"6a99a207df227dc448e97795\",\"name\":\"Under 35s (with valid ID)\",\"price\":1000,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity_sold\":0,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":9007199254740991,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"1\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b5e\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"Neither Day nor Night\",\"sort_key\":\"Neither Day nor Night\",\"description\":\"<p>In this engrossing Jewish morality tale for the modern day, Shmuel (Eli Menashe) is the patriarch of an Orthodox Sephardi family, in the Haredi hub of B’nei Brak. His son, Rafael (Adam Hatuka Peled), is an outstanding Torah student who has his heart set on attending an elite yeshivah. When Rafael’s application is turned down, in favour of a less gifted student from a wealthy family, Shmuel confronts the endemic racism within their primarily Ashkenazi community. An award nominee at the Jerusalem Film Festival, this is a thoughtful, compelling, and beautifully shot exploration of racial tensions within Israel’s ultra-religious societies.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931994231temp-1787931994168-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931993175temp-1787931993020-poster.jpg\",\"trailer_url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UU_pR0QSKAM\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2024\",\"runtime\":\"91\",\"language\":\"Hebrew\",\"country\":\"Israel, France\",\"subtitle_language\":\"English\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Phinehas Veuillet\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527e\",\"name\":\"Feature Film\",\"color\":\"#c78fff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b5a\",\"name\":\"Identity Strand\",\"color\":\"#608ea4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527c\",\"name\":\"Drama\",\"color\":\"#f9b6df\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b11\",\"name\":\"Hebrew Language\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b0d\",\"name\":\"English Subtitles\",\"color\":\"#3697ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.725Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-03T09:58:52.686Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-09T10:40:33.802Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[]},{\"id\":\"6a9708e3415f2c5e1404d898\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"The Sea\",\"description\":\"<h4>This film will be shown in Screen 4.</h4><p><strong>PRICES:</strong></p><p><strong>Adult Standard: £19.45</strong></p><p><strong>Students/Over 60s: £17.45 (Admission with valid ID)</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Tickets for this event are sold directly through Picturehouse Cinemas. Clicking the \\\"Order Tickets\\\" button will take you to their booking website. If you already have an account with Picturehouse Cinemas, you can either log in, or click \\\"Continue as Guest\\\" to proceed.</p><p><strong>Please note: tickets for this event are unreserved. You cannot purchase specific seats.</strong></p><p><br></p><p>For all enquiries relating to your booking, please contact Picturehouse directly.</p><p>Picturehouse Ticket Booking Line: 0871 902 5747 (Calls to the ticket booking line cost 13p per minute, plus your service provider fees.)</p><p>Picturehouse Customer Service: 0207 326 2649 (Phone lines are open Monday to Sunday, 10am to 6pm)</p><p><br></p><h4>This event is part of the New Israel Fund strand.</h4><p><br></p><p><strong style=\\\"background-color: rgb(43, 41, 37); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">This screening will begin at the advertised time with no ads or trailers.</strong></p><p><br></p><h4>Sponsored by</h4><h4>Jane Barclay</h4>\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"Picturehouse Central\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785209\",\"name\":\"Picturehouse Central\",\"short_name\":\"Picturehouse Central\",\"description\":\"For all booking enquiries, please call the venue directly: 0871 902 5747\",\"address\":\"Corner of Great Windmill Street and Shaftesbury Avenue, Piccadilly, London, W1D 7DH\",\"default_capacity\":null,\"color\":\"#ffd500\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"2f0ede00-af54-b297-b756-35c9e6e954ad\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"General Admission\",\"color\":\"#C5112F\",\"_id\":\"6abb90febe943bcc4a4b73d0\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"Wheelchair Space\",\"color\":\"#2F50A1\",\"_id\":\"6abb90febe943bcc4a4b73d1\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Companion Space\",\"color\":\"#F2B950\",\"_id\":\"6abb90febe943bcc4a4b73d2\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"label\":\"General Admission\",\"color\":\"#FF4E50\",\"_id\":\"6abb90febe943bcc4a4b73d3\"},{\"key\":\"5\",\"label\":\"Reserved\",\"color\":\"#CC254A\",\"_id\":\"6abb90febe943bcc4a4b73d4\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-11-07T20:15:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-11-07T22:15:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":false,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"external_tickets_url\":\"https://web.picturehouses.com/order/showtimes/022-122398/tickets\",\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":true,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":0,\"ticket_buckets\":[],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b80\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"The Sea\",\"sort_key\":\"Sea, The\",\"description\":\"<p>A heartbreaking human story exposing the surreal absurdity of the Israeli-Palestinian status quo, The Sea provoked a significant reaction in Israel when it won Best Film at the Israeli Film Academy’s Ophir Awards. Khaled (Muhammad Gazawi) is a Palestinian boy from the West Bank who dreams of seeing the sea. During a school trip to the beach, he is denied passage, due to an issue with his paperwork. Undeterred, he sneaks across the border at night, and heads for the coast. Meanwhile, his father Ribhi (Khalifa Natour), an undocumented worker in Israel, abandons his construction site, in a desperate attempt to find his son.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787932038891temp-1787932038829-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787932037682temp-1787932037529-poster.jpg\",\"trailer_url\":\"https://youtu.be/YRS9RU_Ubrg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2025\",\"runtime\":\"93\",\"language\":\"Hebrew, Arabic\",\"country\":\"Israel\",\"subtitle_language\":\"English\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Shai Carmeli Pollak\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527e\",\"name\":\"Feature Film\",\"color\":\"#c78fff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b81\",\"name\":\"New Israel Fund Strand\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f