20% off</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Please note: this cinema has two-seater sofas as well as individual seats.</p><p>Sofas can only be bought as two seats together, for a combined total price of £34.00.</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\\\"background-color: rgb(43, 41, 37); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">This screening will begin at the advertised time with no ads or trailers.</strong></p><p><br></p><h4>Sponsored by:</h4><h4>Sarah and Paul Phillips</h4>\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"Phoenix Cinema Screen 1\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a99730ef0ab0a9c42cbf3d6\",\"name\":\"Phoenix Cinema Screen 1\",\"short_name\":\"Phoenix Scr1\",\"description\":\"For all booking enquiries, please call the UK Jewish Film box office: 020 3176 0048.\",\"address\":\"52 High Road\\nEast Finchley\\nLondon N2 9PJ\",\"default_capacity\":null,\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"5b8d1728-e836-4af9-915d-513002a54a17\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"Adult Standard\",\"color\":\"#992C4E\",\"_id\":\"6ac7bbdd331f37456b9ad382\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"Premium Seat (wider, more legroom)\",\"color\":\"#FCA700\",\"_id\":\"6ac7bbdd331f37456b9ad383\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Wheelchair Space (call 020 3761 0048 to book)\",\"color\":\"#4176A5\",\"_id\":\"6ac7bbdd331f37456b9ad384\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"label\":\"Companion Seat (call 020 3761 0048 to book)\",\"color\":\"#49A3BA\",\"_id\":\"6ac7bbdd331f37456b9ad385\"},{\"key\":\"5\",\"label\":\"Two-Seater Sofa: Sold as a Pair\",\"color\":\"#286A22\",\"_id\":\"6ac7bbdd331f37456b9ad386\"},{\"key\":\"6\",\"label\":\"Set Aside\",\"color\":\"#878787\",\"_id\":\"6ac7bbdd331f37456b9ad387\"},{\"key\":\"7\",\"label\":\"Front Rows (standard seat)\",\"color\":\"#ff5d00\",\"_id\":\"6ac7bbdd331f37456b9ad388\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-11-08T16:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-11-08T18:00:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibili