\",\"name\":\"Under 35s (with valid ID)\",\"price\":1000,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity_sold\":5,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":9007199254740991,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"1\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b49\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"The Long Journey Home\",\"sort_key\":\"Long Journey Home, The\",\"description\":\"<p>A vital cinematic testament to the Jews of Iraq. Once home to an estimated 180,000 Jews, whose ancestors had been living in the country for over 2,500 years — today, almost none remain. Researcher and filmmaker, David Kahtan, has spent over 20 years putting together this comprehensive documentary. It chronicles the entire history of the Jews of Iraq, from ancient Babylon, through the violent pogrom of the Farhud, and the mass exodus in the 1950s, right up to the modern day. As 2026 marks the 85th anniversary of the Farhud, this is a timely reminder of a lost Jewish community.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788893997425temp-1788893997267-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788893997898temp-1788893997626-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788894012469temp-1788894012217-still.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"94\",\"language\":\"English, Hebrew, Arabic\",\"country\":\"Israel\",\"subtitle_language\":\"English\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"David Kahtan\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b44\",\"name\":\"International Documentary Strand\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785272\",\"name\":\"Documentary\",\"color\":\"#8186d0\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b11\",\"name\":\"Hebrew Language\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b12\",\"name\":\"Arabic Language\",\"color\":\"#608ea4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b0d\",\"name\":\"English Subtitles\",\"color\":\"#3697ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527e\",\"name\":\"Feature Film\",\"color\":\"#c78fff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.695Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-25T09:08:00.848Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a4ea84d7a9f8ab3e4de4530\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"The Suitcase\",\"sort_key\":\"Suitcase, The\",\"description\":\"<p>Through family photos and archival images, a granddaughter connects, back through time, to her grandmother, and draws on the bonds between them to establish her own sense of self. Official Selection: New York Jewish Film Festival, and Toronto Jewish Film Festival. </p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788967493426temp-1788967493376-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788967485831temp-1788967485784-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788967499703temp-1788967499566-still.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"country\":\"Canada\",\"language\":\"French\",\"runtime\":\"4\",\"subtitle_language\":\"English\",\"year\":\"2024\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Laetitia Clareton\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b1e\",\"name\":\"Family Matters\",\"color\":\"#ffbc57\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b14\",\"name\":\"Online\",\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b23\",\"name\":\"French Language\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b0d\",\"name\":\"English Subtitles\",\"color\":\"#3697ff\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"virtual_content\":{\"id\":\"6a4ec3dcfa1d8f5277249218\",\"type\":\"vod\",\"label\":\"DOCU2023_EX3_32_LAETITIA_LA VALISE_PRORES422HQ_STEREO_STA.mov\",\"status\":\"ready\",\"status_percent\":100,\"ev_next_encoding_id\":\"045851a0-7ec1-4b7d-99af-4cdc5e74fdcc\",\"live_chat_visible\":true,\"live_chat_participation_enabled\":true,\"live_chat_show_viewer_count\":true,\"ams_drm_enabled\":true,\"duration\":271104.167,\"file_size\":4993610916,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-08T21:40:44.107Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-08T21:40:44.124Z\",\"platform\":\"ev_next\",\"caption_tracks\":[]},\"created_at\":\"2026-07-08T19:43:09.714Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-09T15:24:59.563Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-09T10:42:24.171Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[]},{\"id\":\"6a9708e5415f2c5e1404d8bb\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"Bookends\",\"description\":\"<h3>+ Pre-Feature Short <em>Purvette</em></h3><h4>This film will be shown in Screen 3.</h4><p><strong>PRICES:</strong></p><p><strong>Adult Standard: £20.00</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Tickets for this event are sold directly through Curzon Cinemas. Clicking the \\\"Order Tickets\\\" button will take you to their booking website.</p><p>There is a £2.00 booking fee for all bookings made via the Curzon website.</p><p><br></p><p>For all enquiries relating to your booking, please contact Curzon directly.</p><p>Curzon Ticket Booking Line: 08719 642838 (Calls to the ticket booking line cost 13p per minute, plus your service provider fees. Please be aware that there is a £2 booking fee for phone bookings.)</p><p>Curzon Customer Service: 01233 555644 (Local rates service. Please be aware, it is not possible to book tickets via this number.)</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\\\"background-color: rgb(43, 41, 37); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">This screening will begin at the advertised time with no ads or trailers.</strong></p><p><br></p><h4>Sponsored by:</h4><h4>Erica and Stuart Peters</h4>\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"Curzon Soho\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47851f8\",\"name\":\"Curzon Soho\",\"short_name\":\"Curzon Soho\",\"description\":\"For all booking enquiries, please call the venue directly: 08719 642838.\\nFor Customer Service queries, call: 01233 555644.\",\"address\":\"Curzon Soho\\n99 Shaftesbury Ave\\nLondon W1D 5DY\",\"default_capacity\":null,\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_categories\":[]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-11-10T18:30:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-11-10T20:30:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6aa94c525bba412e1e2417d2\",\"name\":\"+ Pre-Feature Short\",\"color\":\"#3697ff\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":false,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"external_tickets_url\":\"https://www.curzon.com/ticketing/seats/SOH1-57550/\",\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":true,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":0,\"ticket_buckets\":[],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b59\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"Bookends\",\"sort_key\":\"Bookends\",\"description\":\"<p>A tender story of life, love, and family, starring legendary actors, F. Murray Abraham and Caroline Aaron. Nate (Noam Ash) is an aspiring young writer living in Manhattan. After breaking up with his boyfriend, he is forced to move in with his grandparents, Saul (Abraham) and Miriam (Aaron). They live in a sleepy Jewish retirement community, upstate. Nate uses the time away from the city to work on his new book, and begins a relationship with Daniel (Charlie Barnett), a handsome Jewish doctor. But when Saul begins showing signs of cognitive decline, Nate must decide what is most important to him. Winner of the prestigious Stand Up Award at the Santa Barbara International Film Festival.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788893924192temp-1788893924048-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788893906892temp-1788893906644-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788893923832temp-1788893923632-still.jpg\",\"trailer_url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0bYA_fIJ1iE\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"99\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"USA\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Mike Doyle\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b5a\",\"name\":\"Identity Strand\",\"color\":\"#608ea4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527f\",\"name\":\"Comedy\",\"color\":\"#ffdeee\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527c\",\"name\":\"Drama\",\"color\":\"#f9b6df\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b32\",\"name\":\"Comedy Drama\",\"color\":\"#3697ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.718Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-08T18:58:43.630Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a9e96804ea6c80478459328\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"Purvette\",\"sort_key\":\"Purvette\",\"description\":\"<p>A portrait of the 102-year-old DJ and legendary pioneer of drag shows in London, Jo Purvis. Purvis, who was named by QX Magazine as a “living legend of the gay scene” talks about her life and career.</p><p><br></p><p>Commissioned by UK Jewish Film</p><p><strong>Funded by</strong></p><p><strong>Nightingale Hammerson</strong></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.com/eventive-static/c869e61d03fa22509eee589860a982b5.png\\\" width=\\\"204\\\"></p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1727216793251334ac03d79af82bb9b58.jpg?fit=crop&w=960&h=380\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1727216813139d03298675e9b5127ae11.jpg?w=300\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1727216800508dfde1884616e00a52c4e.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"country\":\"United Kingdom\",\"language\":\"English\",\"runtime\":\"5\",\"year\":\"2024\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Alex Eisenberg\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785272\",\"name\":\"Documentary\",\"color\":\"#8186d0\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a9e96804ea6c8047845932d\",\"name\":\"LGBTQ+\",\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527a\",\"name\":\"World Premiere\",\"color\":\"#b0f48a\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527b\",\"name\":\"UK & Ireland Film Programme\",\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a9e96804ea6c8047845932e\",\"name\":\"The Rainbow Collection Shorts\",\"color\":\"#f974cf\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"virtual_content\":{\"id\":\"67118170327622004fde5f44\",\"type\":\"vod\",\"label\":\"PURVETTE - ALEX EISENBERG - 2024 - WEB - SUBTITLED.mp4\",\"status\":\"ready\",\"status_percent\":100,\"ev_next_encoding_id\":\"25041fdd-4026-44ea-87c2-3a7868dbddda\",\"live_chat_visible\":true,\"live_chat_participation_enabled\":true,\"live_chat_show_viewer_count\":true,\"ams_drm_enabled\":true,\"duration\":314346.667,\"file_size\":395762466,\"created_at\":\"2024-10-17T21:28:16.845Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2024-10-17T21:28:16.862Z\",\"platform\":\"ev_next\",\"caption_tracks\":[]},\"created_at\":\"2026-09-07T10:48:32.818Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-24T14:14:47.062Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-09T10:42:36.225Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[]},{\"id\":\"6a9708e5415f2c5e1404d8c4\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"Dangoor Short Doc Fund Premieres + Q&As\",\"description\":\"<h3>+ Q&amp;As with Filmmakers</h3><p><strong>PRICES:</strong></p><p><strong>Front two rows: £15.00</strong></p><p><strong>Adult Standard: £17.00</strong></p><p><strong>Premium Seat (extra width and legroom): £21.50</strong></p><p><strong>Under 35s: £10.00 (Admission with valid ID)</strong></p><p><strong>Student Rush: £5.00 (10 minutes before screening, subject to availability, with valid ID)</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>UK Jewish Film Members: 20% off</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Please note: this cinema has two-seater sofas as well as individual seats.</p><p>Sofas can only be bought as two seats together, for a combined total price of £34.00.</p><p><br></p><p>We are delighted to bring you the five winners of the sixth Dangoor UKJF Short Doc Fund.</p><p><br></p><p>The fund supports filmmakers in the production of five-minute, micro-budget films, documenting aspects of contemporary British-Jewish life. In an era of rising antisemitism, the fund aims to build a lasting, innovative, and educational film collection reflecting the unique traditions, customs, culture, and everyday lives of British Jews in the 21st century.</p><p><br></p><p>This event includes the World Premiere screening of <em>The Dead Parent Club</em> from UK Jewish Film's brand-new <em>Changing Perspectives</em> fund.</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\\\"background-color: rgb(43, 41, 37); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">This screening will begin at the advertised time with no ads or trailers.</strong></p><p><br></p><h4>Sponsored by:</h4><p><img src=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.com/eventive-static/29d860a80cf2c82aca69fca3dca21005.jpg\\\" width=\\\"225\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%;\\\"></p>\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"Phoenix Cinema Screen 1\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a99730ef0ab0a9c42cbf3d6\",\"name\":\"Phoenix Cinema Screen 1\",\"short_name\":\"Phoenix Scr1\",\"description\":\"For all booking enquiries, please call the UK Jewish Film box office: 020 3176 0048.\",\"address\":\"52 High Road\\nEast Finchley\\nLondon N2 9PJ\",\"default_capacity\":null,\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"5b8d1728-e836-4af9-915d-513002a54a17\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"Adult Standard\",\"color\":\"#992C4E\",\"_id\":\"6ac7bbdd331f37456b9ad382\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"Premium Seat (wider, more legroom)\",\"color\":\"#FCA700\",\"_id\":\"6ac7bbdd331f37456b9ad383\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Wheelchair Space (call 020 3761 0048 to book)\",\"color\":\"#4176A5\",\"_id\":\"6ac7bbdd331f37456b9ad384\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"label\":\"Companion Seat (call 020 3761 0048 to book)\",\"color\":\"#49A3BA\",\"_id\":\"6ac7bbdd331f37456b9ad385\"},{\"key\":\"5\",\"label\":\"Two-Seater Sofa: Sold as a Pair\",\"color\":\"#286A22\",\"_id\":\"6ac7bbdd331f37456b9ad386\"},{\"key\":\"6\",\"label\":\"Set Aside\",\"color\":\"#878787\",\"_id\":\