"The Dead Parent Club\",\"sort_key\":\"Dead Parent Club, The\",\"description\":\"<p>Ollie’s dad has unexpectedly died, and neither is ready to let go. With an unlikely sidekick, Ollie embarks on a chaotic, thoughtful quest for peace.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789384640832temp-1789384640425-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789384641823temp-1789384641080-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789384635564temp-1789384634882-still.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"15\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Mark Fleischmann\",\"producer\":\"Jesse Romain\",\"screenwriter\":\"Mark Fleischmann\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b09\",\"name\":\"Changing Perspectives Film Fund\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.576Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-14T11:17:20.423Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04afe\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"Fish, Chips & Faith\",\"sort_key\":\"Fish, Chips & Faith\",\"description\":\"<p>Fish, Chips & Faith tells the uplifting story of a Leeds restaurant bringing communities together by serving Kosher and Halal food under one roof.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931926719temp-1787931926616-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931925569temp-1787931925377-poster.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"6\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Micaela Blitz, Miriam Rosenberg\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478526b\",\"name\":\"Dangoor UKJF Short Doc Fund\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.556Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-09T11:19:34.628Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b02\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"Mizrahi Mismatch\",\"sort_key\":\"Mizrahi Mismatch\",\"description\":\"<p>Judith and Menahem met in 1959, and wed within weeks. They are fire and water, ghormeh sabzi and gachun, yet somehow have survived 67 years together.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1790069967722temp-1790069967536-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1790069948628temp-1790069948303-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1790069967292temp-1790069966985-still.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"5\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Misha Mansoor\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478526b\",\"name\":\"Dangoor UKJF Short Doc Fund\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.565Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-22T09:39:26.982Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b06\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"Rambling\",\"sort_key\":\"Rambling\",\"description\":\"<p>Over the last 50 years The Pennine Wayfarers have become a community all of their own. Combining friendship and adventure, they travel a route that resonates with British-Jewish history.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931934825temp-1787931934741-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931933876temp-1787931933813-poster.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"6\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Jack Levy\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478526b\",\"name\":\"Dangoor UKJF Short Doc Fund\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.572Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-09T11:18:46.060Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b00\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"The Last Jewel\",\"sort_key\":\"Last Jewel, The\",\"description\":\"<p>At 89, Joseph Ullmann keeps the tradition of his grandfather’s Budapest antique jewellery business alive. In today's Hatton Garden, he and his shop are the last of their kind.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931928687temp-1787931928661-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931927770temp-1787931927748-poster.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"5\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Rob Kaplan\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478526b\",\"name\":\"Dangoor UKJF Short Doc Fund\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"