<strong>PRICES:</strong></p><p><strong>Front two rows: £15.00</strong></p><p><strong>Adult Standard: £17.00</strong></p><p><strong>Premium Seat (extra width and legroom): £21.50</strong></p><p><strong>Under 35s: £10.00 (Admission with valid ID)</strong></p><p><strong>Student Rush: £5.00 (10 minutes before screening, subject to availability, with valid ID)</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>UK Jewish Film Members: 20% off</strong></p><p>.</p><p>Please note: this cinema has two-seater sofas as well as individual seats.</p><p>Sofas can only be bought as two seats together, for a combined total price of £34.00.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Warning: contains scenes of sexual violence.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\\\"background-color: rgb(43, 41, 37); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span class=\\\"ql-cursor\\\">﻿</span>This screening will begin at the advertised time with no ads or trailers.</strong></p><p><br></p><h4>Sponsored by:</h4><h4>Jane Grabiner</h4><h4>Joyce and David Kustow OBE</h4>\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"Phoenix Cinema Screen 1\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a99730ef0ab0a9c42cbf3d6\",\"name\":\"Phoenix Cinema Screen 1\",\"short_name\":\"Phoenix Scr1\",\"description\":\"For all booking enquiries, please call the UK Jewish Film box office: 020 3176 0048.\",\"address\":\"52 High Road\\nEast Finchley\\nLondon N2 9PJ\",\"default_capacity\":null,\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"5b8d1728-e836-4af9-915d-513002a54a17\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"Adult Standard\",\"color\":\"#992C4E\",\"_id\":\"6ac7bbdd331f37456b9ad382\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"Premium Seat (wider, more legroom)\",\"color\":\"#FCA700\",\"_id\":\"6ac7bbdd331f37456b9ad383\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Wheelchair Space (call 020 3761 0048 to book)\",\"color\":\"#4176A5\",\"_id\":\"6ac7bbdd331f37456b9ad384\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"label\":\"Companion Seat (call 020 3761 0048 to book)\",\"color\":\"#49A3B