ren and Lawrence Lever</h4>\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"Everyman Belsize Park\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478520d\",\"name\":\"Everyman Belsize Park\",\"short_name\":\"Everyman Belsize Pk\",\"description\":\"For all booking enquiries, please call the UK Jewish Film box office: 020 3176 0048.\",\"address\":\"203 Haverstock Hill\\nBelsize Park\\nLondon \\nNW3 4QG\",\"default_capacity\":null,\"color\":\"#a326ff\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"fe3b9596-ce5c-1015-a950-49d47c25d6d6\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"2-Seater Sofa: Sold as a pair\",\"color\":\"#286A22\",\"_id\":\"6abbe46acc7d5284510a8855\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"Single armchair\",\"color\":\"#992C4E\",\"_id\":\"6abbe46acc7d5284510a8856\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Wheelchair Space (call 020 3761 0048 to book)\",\"color\":\"#4176A5\",\"_id\":\"6abbe46acc7d5284510a8857\"},{\"key\":\"5\",\"label\":\"Companion Seat (call 020 3761 0048 to book)\",\"color\":\"#49A3BA\",\"_id\":\"6abbe46acc7d5284510a8858\"},{\"key\":\"6\",\"label\":\"Set Aside\",\"color\":\"#878787\",\"_id\":\"6abbe46acc7d5284510a8859\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-11-14T18:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-11-14T20:00:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":false,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity\":0,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a9984629f9485e4fc5b54a8\",\"name\":\"Single armchair\",\"price\":1700,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity_sold\":4,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":9007199254740991,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"2\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"rush_line_price\":null,\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null},{\"id\":\"6a9984629f9485e4fc5b54ab\",\"name\":\"2-Seater Sofa: Sold as a pair\",\"price\":1700,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity_sold\":2,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":9007199254740991,\"reserved_seating_category\":\"1\",\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b5c\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"Girls Like Us\",\"sort_key\":\"Girls Like Us\",\"description\":\"<p>Winner of three Ophir Awards from the Israeli Film Academy, Girls Like Us is a gritty, but deeply moving portrayal of life on the fringes of Israeli society. Shahar (Hili Yosef Zada) is a 17-year-old girl from a complicated family background. Her father has been committed to a psychiatric hospital whilst her mother is an alcoholic. Shahar must fend for herself and raise her younger sister alone. She attends a school for at-risk girls and finds a sense of sisterhood amongst her classmates. When 19-year-old Perry (Hadar Dror), a soldier-counsellor, arrives at the school, she and Shahar develop a strong emotional bond through their shared trauma.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931991543temp-1787931991522-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931987109temp-1787931986936-poster.jpg\",\"trailer_url\":\"https://youtu.be/lemkOF0kREw\",\"unballoted