collapses in the face of the German advance during World War Two, Jean Chevalin (actor and comedian, Benoît Poelvoorde) is a bumbling soldier who deserts his post. Returning to his family in rural France, he sees only one means of escape: by pretending to be Jewish, they can escape to the Free Zone. As his misguided plan leads from one absurdity to another, Jean witnesses the reality of the Nazi occupation for France’s Jews.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787932002693temp-1787932002669-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931999113temp-1787931998786-poster.jpg\",\"trailer_url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ePucMqkx-Rw\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2025\",\"runtime\":\"100\",\"language\":\"French\",\"country\":\"France\",\"subtitle_language\":\"English\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Pascal Elbe\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527e\",\"name\":\"Feature Film\",\"color\":\"#c78fff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b5a\",\"name\":\"Identity Strand\",\"color\":\"#608ea4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b61\",\"name\":\"Historical Comedy\",\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527f\",\"name\":\"Comedy\",\"color\":\"#ffdeee\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b23\",\"name\":\"French Language\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b0d\",\"name\":\"English Subtitles\",\"color\":\"#3697ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.729Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-03T09:57:34.134Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-09T10:45:59.591Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[]},{\"id\":\"6a9708ea415f2c5e1404d922\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"Think Good\",\"description\":\"<h3>+ Pre-Feature Short <em>Fighting Back</em></h3><p><strong>PRICES:</strong></p><p><strong>Adult Standard: £17.00</strong></p><p><strong>Under 35s: £10.00 (Admission with valid ID)</strong></p><p><strong>Student Rush: £5.00 (Student Rush Tickets, 10 minutes before screening, subject to availability, with valid ID)</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>UK Jewish Film Members: 20% off</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Please note: this cinema has two-seater sofas as well as individual armchairs. Sofas can only be bought as two seats together, for a combined total price of £34.00 (or £10.00 for Student Rush tickets).</p><p><br></p><p><strong>WARNING: contains scenes of domestic abuse.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\\\"background-color: rgb(43, 41, 37); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span class=\\\"ql-cursor\\\">﻿</span>This screening will begin at the advertised time with no ads or trailers.</strong></p><p><br></p><h4>Sponsored by:</h4><h4>Jeffrey Gruder KC and Gillian Gruder</h4>\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"Everyman Belsize Park\",\"ve