oth stay home? Or, together, do they attend what turns out to be the Nova Music Festival on Oct 7th? This compelling watch was nominated for the Best Short Award, Israeli Academy Awards, 2025, and was in the Official Selection at the Jerusalem Film Festival, 2025.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788967374735temp-1788967374529-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788967365568temp-1788967365274-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788967382856temp-1788967382648-still.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"country\":\"Israel\",\"language\":\"Hebrew\",\"runtime\":\"18\",\"subtitle_language\":\"English\",\"year\":\"2025\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Rona Segal\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b10\",\"name\":\"Israeli Shorts\",\"color\":\"#ffbc57\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b14\",\"name\":\"Online\",\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b11\",\"name\":\"Hebrew Language\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b0d\",\"name\":\"English Subtitles\",\"color\":\"#3697ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"virtual_content\":{\"id\":\"6a64fe68012cb792041adba7\",\"type\":\"vod\",\"label\":\"go2films_-_not_my_weekend_-_english_-_for_preview%20%281080p%29.mp4?loc=external&signature=56dfd453ea3b503ca63e6e0913f0e094d8b2ce4dcb185efe481ad08b751b231b\",\"status\":\"ready\",\"status_percent\":100,\"ev_next_encoding_id\":\"56c26059-e0a9-4b81-ad10-2d7a9995e6e1\",\"live_chat_visible\":true,\"live_chat_participation_enabled\":true,\"live_chat_show_viewer_count\":true,\"ams_drm_enabled\":true,\"duration\":1136681.6670000001,\"file_size\":528515280,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T18:20:24.964Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-25T18:20:24.977Z\",\"platform\":\"ev_next\",\"caption_tracks\":[]},\"created_at\":\"2026-07-23T07:45:46.227Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-09T15:23:02.645Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a61c0aebcc1a7d200670e4e\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"The Eulogy\",\"sort_key\":\"Eulogy, The\",\"description\":\"<p>Two brothers approach their mother's funeral in very different ways: one has too much to say, and the other, despite his money and apparent success, can't get his thoughts together. Added to this, their mother was so large she needs a double plot, and this holds up the proceedings, delaying the dreaded eulogy.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788967336495temp-1788967336433-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788967328781temp-1788967328742-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788967343541temp-1788967343498-still.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"country\":\"Israel\",\"language\":\"Hebrew\",\"runtime\":\"21\",\"subtitle_language\":\"English\",\"year\":\"2025\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Moran Rosenblatt\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b10\",\"name\":\"Israeli Shorts\",\"color\":\"#ffbc57\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b14\",\"name\":\"Online\",\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\