wish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"You're Perfect, Keep Going\",\"sort_key\":\"You're Perfect, Keep Going\",\"description\":\"<p>Amalya is restless in her relationship with her long-term partner. When she heads out to a party, alone, she meets Avia, a beautiful and captivating woman who makes her question what freedom and commitment really mean.</p><p><strong>WARNING: contains scenes of a sexual nature.</strong></p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789657719583temp-1789657719414-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789657720077temp-1789657719768-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789657719172temp-1789657718875-still.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"country\":\"Israel\",\"language\":\"Hebrew\",\"runtime\":\"15\",\"subtitle_language\":\"English\",\"year\":\"2025\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Yaaley Weiss\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b26\",\"name\":\"Rainbow Collection\",\"color\":\"#608ea4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785266\",\"name\":\"LGBTQIA+\",\"color\":\"#ff8fdc\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b14\",\"name\":\"Online\",\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b11\",\"name\":\"Hebrew Language\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b0d\",\"name\":\"English Subtitles\",\"color\":\"#3697ff\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"virtual_content\":{\"id\":\"6abff87bc39fa6bf27e3b017\",\"type\":\"vod\",\"label\":\"Keep Going, You're Perfect 10Gb.mp4\",\"status\":\"ready