ps and the aspirations and dreams shared by many Israelis today.\",\"description\":\"<p>Having been together for over 40 years, Meir and Tova (the wonderful Sasson Gabay and Rita Shukrun), lead a comfortable if passionless life. When they meet their new neighbour, a showy, hedonistic, middle-aged man who loves hosting loud karaoke parties in his flashy penthouse — beautifully played by Lior Ashkenazi — the way they see themselves and their relationship dramatically changes. Funny, heartfelt, and sharp, this impressive debut feature captures the nature of long-term relationships and the aspirations and dreams shared by many Israelis today. </p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931947126temp-1787931947070-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931945532temp-1787931945407-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/4301ebd6acdc7f19fe37763ff230bc28.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"language\":\"Hebrew\",\"runtime\":\"103\",\"year\":\"2022\",\"country\":\"Israel\",\"subtitle_language\":\"English\"},\"credits\":{\"animator\":null,\"cast\":\"Lior Ashkenazi, Sasson Gabai, Rita Shukrun\",\"cinematographer\":\"Daniel Miller\",\"co_producer\":null,\"composer\":\"Gal Lev, Lior Perla\",\"director\":\"Moshe Rosenthal\",\"editor\":\"Dafi Farbman\",\"executive_producer\":\"Ben Giladi, Dubi Rubinstein\",\"filmmaker\":null,\"music\":null,\"producer\":\"Efrat Cohen\",\"production_design\":null,\"screenwriter\":\"Moshe Rosenthal\",\"sound_design\":null},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b2e\",\"name\":\"Best of 30 Strand\",\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527e\",\"name\":\"Feature Film\",\"color\":\"#c78fff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b14\",\"name\":\"Online\",\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527e\",\"name\":\"Feature Film\",\"color\":\"#c78fff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771