 with an Online Festival Pass</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Part of our Best of 30 strand, showcasing some of the best films to feature in the UK Jewish Film Festival over the past 30 years.</p>\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"venue\":{},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-11-30T23:59:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478526f\",\"name\":\"Feature Films\",\"color\":\"#ff8fdc\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b2e\",\"name\":\"Best of 30 Strand\",\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":false,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":false,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":150,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"6a9ec382b8ce534df6e8ba32\",\"name\":\"Virtual Admission\",\"price\":1500,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":150,\"quantity_sold\":15,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":135,\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a33ab9fb626301af32dd6af\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"The Kindergarten Teacher\",\"sort_key\":\"Kindergarten Teacher, The\",\"description\":\"<p>In Nadav Lapid’s highly original and mesmerising second feature (selected for the Cannes Film Festival’s Un Certain Regard), a frustrated nursery-school teacher spots a five-year-old poetic prodigy, and sets out both to nurture his talent and protect him from corrupting influences. As her protective instincts spiral deliriously into obsession, Avi Shnaidman’s revelatory performance touches on a tantalising ambiguity between control and innocence. Blessed with an auteur’s touch, writer-director, Nadav Lapid (Policeman), has crafted a blazing confirmation of his talent. </p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931956023temp-1787931955936-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931954802temp-1787931954570-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/257519ccc64b54b0d3560d5713fcaa49.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"language\":\"Hebrew\",\"runtime\":\"120\",\"year\":\"2014\",\"country\":\"France, Israel\",\"subtitle_language\":\"English\"},\"credits\":{\"animator\":null,\"cast\":\"Sarit Larry, Avi Shnaidman, Lior Raz\",\"cinematographer\":\"Shai Goldman\",\"co_producer\":null,\"composer\":\"Michael Emet\",\"director\":\"Nadav Lapid\",\"editor\":\"Era Lapid\",\"executive_producer\":null,\"filmmaker\":null,\"music\":null,\"producer\":\"Carole Scotta, Osnat Handelsman-Keren, Talia Kleinhendler\",\"production_design\":null,\"screenwriter\":\"Nadav Lapid\",\"sound_design\":null},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b2e\",\"name\":\"Best of 30 Strand\",\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527e\",\"name\":\"Feature Film\",\"color\":\"#c78fff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b14\",\"name\":\"Online\",\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527e\",\"name\":\"Feature Film\",\"color\":\"#c78fff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527c\",\"name\":\"Drama\",\"color\":\"#f9b6df\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b11\