\":\"For all booking enquiries, please call the venue directly: 0330 333 4444\",\"address\":\"Parrs Wood Entertainment Centre, Wilmslow Rd, Didsbury, Manchester M20 5PG\",\"default_capacity\":null,\"color\":\"#3697ff\",\"use_reserved_seating\":false,\"comscore_include\":false},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-11-24T19:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-11-24T21:00:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6aa7f91cd5377103a57d3463\",\"name\":\"Manchester\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":false,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"external_tickets_url\":\" https://web.cineworld.co.uk/order/showtimes/051-248622/seats\",\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":true,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":0,\"ticket_buckets\":[],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b85\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"Tell Me Everything\",\"sort_key\":\"Tell Me Everything\",\"description\":\"<p>A wonderfully nuanced coming-of-age story and the second feature from hotshot Israeli director Moshe Rosenthal (Karoake, Opening Night Gala at the 2022 UK Jewish Film Festival). Boaz (Yair Mazor as a child, and Ido Tako as an adult) is a pop-music-obsessed 12 year old, who idolises his father, Meir (Assi Cohen). But Boaz soon discovers a devastating secret about his dad that shakes the very foundations of his life. Premiering in the UK, following its debut at Sundance, where it became the first Israeli film to screen at the festival in a decade. A sensation of Israeli cinema, it opened the Jerusalem Film Festival, and was nominated for a record-breaking 16 Israel Film Academy Awards, including Best Picture.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787932041480temp-1787932041367-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787932040119temp-1787932039929-poster.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"109\",\"language\":\"Hebrew\",\"country\":\"Israel\",\"subtitle_language\":\"English\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Moshe Rosenthal\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b41\",\"name\":\"Best Film Award Nominee\",\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527e\",\"name\":\"Feature Film\",\"color\":\"#c78fff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b81\",\"name\":\"New Israel Fund Strand\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527c\",\"name\":\"Drama\",\"color\":\"#f9b6df\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b11\",\"name\":\"Hebrew Language\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b0d\",\"name\":\"English Subtitles\",\"color\":\"#3697ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.801Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.801Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-13T14:48:50.462Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[]},{\"id\":\"6aa80388d60d7c117dcc4afc\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"The Soundman\",\"description\":\"<h6>\\\"This film is a standout: meditative, innovative, and profoundly moving.\\\"&nbsp;</h6><h3><em>The Hollywood Times</em></h3><h6>\\\"The Soundman is a film like an opera, where music, play and image come together in optimal synergy\\\"</h6><h3><em>Cinemagazine</em></h3><h6>“The Soundman is a poetic declaration of love to the world of sound and at the same time a moving historical drama”</h6><h3><em>Moviebreak</em></h3><p><br></p><h4>This film will be shown in Cinema 1</h4><p><strong>PRICES:</strong></p><p><strong>Adult Standard: £11.15</strong></p><p><strong>Concession (Student, Senior Citizen, Disability): £9.15</strong></p><p><strong>Unwaged: £7.95</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Tickets for this event are sold directly through HOME Cinema Manchester. Clicking the \\\"Order Tickets\\\" button will take you to their booking website.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For all enquiries relating to your booking, please contact HOME directly.</p><p>Box Office: 0161 200 1500</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(43, 41, 37);\\\">This screening will begin at the advertised time with no ads or trailers.</strong></p>\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"HOME Manchester\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47851f0\",\"name\":\"HOME Manchester\",\"short_name\":\"HOME Manchester\",\"description\":\"For all booking enquiries, please call the venue directly: 0161 200 1500\",\"address\":\"2 Tony Wilson Place\\nManchester\\nM15 4FN\",\"default_capacity\":null,\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"use_reserved_seating\":false,\"comscore_include\":false},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-11-25T18:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-11-25T20:00:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6aa7f91cd5377103a57d3463\",\"name\":\"Manchester\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":false,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"external_tickets_url\":\"https://www.homemcr.org/spektrix/ChooseSeats?EventInstanceId=2038801APGCRTVVMSVSGVHHBRCQPPKSJR\",\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":true,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":0,\"ticket_buckets\":[],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b4d\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"The Soundman\",\"sort_key\":\"Soundman, The\",\"description\":\"<p>A beautiful portrayal of young love swept up by the dark tides of history, and a remarkable cinematic depiction of sound. In May 1940, German forces are massing along the borders of Belgium, Luxembourg, and the Netherlands. At a Brussels radio station, Elza (Femke Vanhove) is a talented young voice actor. She’s also, secretly, a Jewish refugee from Vienna. Meanwhile, Berre (Jef Hellemans) is an innovative introverted sound engineer, who creates the sound effects for the station's radio plays. The two fall deeply in love, but as war looms, and Elza’s true identity is exposed, their relationship is put to the ultimate test.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1791287981705temp-1791287981644-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1791287989805temp-1791287989748-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1791287989517temp-1791287989461-still.jpg\",\"trailer_url\":\"https://youtu.be/cmLvljVT4pY?si=DMJa4OoocUQVXSSI\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2025\",\"runtime\":\"120\",\"language\":\"Dutch, Hebrew\",\"country\":\"Belgium\",\"subtitle_language\":\"English\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Frank Van Passel\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b4e\",\"name\":\"Memory Strand\",\"color\":\"#ffbc57\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527c\",\"name\":\"Drama\",\"color\":\"#f9b6df\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b4f\",\"name\":\"Historical Drama\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b50\",\"name\":\"Dutch Language\",\"color\":\"#ff8fdc\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b11\",\"name\":\"Hebrew Language\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b0d\",\"name\":\"English Subtitles\",\"color\":\"#3697ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527e\",\"name\":\"Feature Film\",\"color\":\"#c78fff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.702Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-08T14:10:22.745Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-12T16:28:47.984Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_r