 follows a young Welsh Jewish girl on her quest for a boyfriend, while also trying to prepare for her upcoming Bat Mitzvah.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931939299temp-1787931939249-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931938446temp-1787931938410-poster.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"15\",\"language\":\"English, Welsh\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"subtitle_language\":\"English\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Talia Smith\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b09\",\"name\":\"Changing Perspectives Film Fund\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b0c\",\"name\":\"Welsh Language\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b0d\",\"name\":\"English Subtitles\",\"color\":\"#3697ff\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.580Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.580Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b00\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"The Last Jewel\",\"sort_key\":\"Last Jewel, The\",\"description\":\"<p>At 89, Joseph Ullmann keeps the tradition of his grandfather’s Budapest antique jewellery business alive. In today's Hatton Garden, he and his shop are the last of their kind.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931928687temp-1787931928661-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931927770temp-1787931927748-poster.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"5\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Rob Kaplan\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478526b\",\"name\":\"Dangoor UKJF Short Doc Fund\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.561Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.561Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b08\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"The Dead Parent Club\",\"sort_key\":\"Dead Parent Club, The\",\"description\":\"<p>Ollie’s dad has unexpectedly died, and neither is ready to let go. With an unlikely sidekick, Ollie embarks on a chaotic, thoughtful quest for peace.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789384640832temp-1789384640425-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789384641823temp-1789384641080-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789384635564temp-1789384634882-still.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"15\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Mark Fleischmann\",\"producer\":\"Jesse Romain\",\"screenwriter\":\"Mark Fleischmann\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b09\",\"name\":\"Changing Perspectives Film Fund\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.576Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-14T11:17:20.423Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b04\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"Oslo Court\",\"sort_key\":\"Oslo Court\",\"description\":\"<p>A film about the 1970s-style London restaurant, Oslo Court, and its cultural importance to the Jewish community, with waiter, Neil, at its beating heart.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931932656temp-1787931932612-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931931811temp-1787931931771-poster.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"5\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Hermione Oldham\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478526b\",\"name\":\"Dangoor UKJF Short Doc Fund\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.569Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.569Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04afa\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"The Goyfriend\",\"sort_key\":\"Goyfriend, The\",\"description\":\"<p>Aviva is excited to bring James to his first Passover Seder, until her parents admit that grandma has no idea that her potential future grandson-in-law isn’t Jewish. Determined to keep the peace, Aviva’s family attempt to pass James off as 'one of us'.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789395207832temp-1789395207615-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789395225063temp-1789395224739-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789395224557temp-1789395224245-still.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"17\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Ashley Margolis\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527d\",\"name\":\"Pears Short Film Fund\",\"color\":\"#ff8fdc\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.542Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-14T14:13:44.244Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-13T11:58:11.581Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{\"cover\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1791216200655temp-1791216200533-cover.jpg\",\"avatar\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1791216200968temp-1791216200878-avatar.jpg\"},\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[]},{\"id\":\"6aa80388d60d7c117dcc4b0c\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"Rose\",\"description\":\"<h3>Relaxed Screening</h3><h4>This film will be shown in Cinema 1</h4><p><strong>PRICES:</strong></p><p><strong>Adult Standard: £9.15</strong></p><p><strong>Concession (Student, Senior Citizen): £7.15</strong></p><p><strong>Unwaged: £5.95</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Tickets for this event are sold directly through HOME Cinema Manchester. Clicking the \\\"Order Tickets\\\" button will take you to their booking website.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For all enquiries relating to your booking, please contact HOME directly.</p><p>Box Office: 0161 200 1500</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Relaxed Events at HomeMCR:</strong></p><p>Relaxed Events are designed to improve the experience of Neurodiverse, Autistic and Learning-Disabled audiences. These events are also suitable for people with sensory conditions, dementia, or disabilities.</p><p>The typical set up for HomeMCR's relaxed events includes:</p><ul><li>Lights on low</li><li>Volume turned down a little</li><li>An introduction for a member of staff/ volunteer/ visiting practitioner</li><li>You can move in and out of the space freely</li><li>Where possible, HomeMCR aims to provide a separate chill-out space for relaxed events.</li><li>There is a brief, 2-minute video that outlines the expectations and there will be no adverts before the film.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(43, 41, 37);\\\">This screening will begin at the advertised time with no ads or trailers.</strong></p>\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"HOME Manchester\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47851f0\",\"name\":\"HOME Manchester\",\"short_name\":\"HOME Manchester\",\"description\":\"For all booking enquiries, please call the venue directly: 0161 200 1500\",\"address\":\"2 Tony Wilson Place\\nManchester\\nM15 4FN\",\"default_capacity\":null,\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"use_reserved_seating\":false,\"comscore_include\":false},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-12-01T15:45:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-12-01T17:45:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6aa7f91cd5377103a57d3463\",\"name\":\"Manchester\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":false,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"external_tickets_url\":\"https://www.homemcr.org/spektrix/ChooseSeats?EventInstanceId=2039201AKHTPMNDGJJJRQSPBCJDLKQLTT\",\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":true,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":0,\"ticket_buckets\":[],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a300841525bdd62d12dda09\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"Rose\",\"sort_key\":\"Rose\",\"description\":\"<p>Françoise Fabian (My Night at Maud’s, Belle de Jour, Call My Agent), Grégory Montel (Call My Agent), and Aure Atika (The Night Manager, OSS 117: Cairo, Nest of Spies) star in this warm-hearted Parisian Jewish family drama. When patriarch, Philippe, dies, his wife, Rose, feels that her life is over. A chance dinner party, however, re-ignites her joie de vivre, much to the discomfort of her three loving but somewhat dysfunctional children. Unsure how to deal with this new vivacious version of their mother, Rose’s children's concerns can’t stop her celebrating life again. Honest, beautifully observed, and laced with a treasure trove of Yiddish and Mizrahi songs, this is a life-affirming and accomplished debut feature, from director Aurélie Saada. Michael Etherton</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788430768283temp-1788430767517-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788430769663temp-1788430768506-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788430786446temp-1788430785379-still.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"country\":\"France\",\"language\":\"French\",\"runtime\":\"103\",\"subtitle_language\":\"English\",\"year\":\"2020\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Aurélie Saada\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527e\",\"name\":\"Feature Film\",\"color\":\"#c78fff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b2e\",\"name\":\"Best of 30 Strand\",\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527c\",\"name\":\"Drama\",\"color\":\"#f9b6df\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b23\",\"name\":\"French Language\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b0d\",\"name\":\"English Subtitles\",\"color\":\"#3697ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-06-15T14:12:17.610Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-03T10:19:45.377Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-12T16:29:46.698Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[]},{\"id\":\"6aa80388d60d7c117dcc4b18\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"British-Jewish Life on Film: Sheffield\",\"description\":\"<h4>This film will be shown in Screen 2</h4><p><strong>Prices:</strong></p><p><strong>Adult Standard: £12.00</strong></p><p><strong>Concessions (CEA Cardholder, Blue Light, Student): £10.00</strong></p><p><strong>Cine26 Members: £6.00</strong></p><p><br></p><p>All orders placed with Sheffield Showroom will be subject to a fee of £1.50.</p><p><br></p><p>We are proud to present <em>British Jewish Life on Film 2026: </em>an evening of brand new films about British Jewish life. These films were all commissioned this year by UKJF's Film Factory, with the aim of demonstrating the absolute diversity of our community. A series of mini-documentaries and short dramas tell Jewish stories from the length and breadth of the UK.</p><p><br></p><p>You'll laugh, you'll cry, you'll be entertained, you'll discover things you didn't know, and just by turning up to the screening you'll meet other local members of the Jewish community.</p><p><br></p><p>Above all else, you're guaranteed to leave feeling a renewed sense of Jewish pride.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\\\"background-color: rgb(43, 41, 37); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">This screening will begin at the advertised time with no ads or trailers.</strong></p>\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"Showroom Sheffield\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47851f1\",\"name\":\"Showroom Sheffield\",\"short_name\":\"Showroom Sheffield\",\"description\":\"For all booking enquiries, please call the venue directly on: 0114 275 7727\",\"address\":\"The Workstation, Paternoster Row, Sheffield City Centre, Sheffield S1 2BX\",\"default_capacity\":null,\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"use_reserved_seating\":false,\"comscore_include\":false},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-12-02T18:15:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-12-02T20:15:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6aa7f91cd5377103a57d3460\",\"name\":\"British Jewish Life on Film\",\"color\":\"#ff8fdc\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":false,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"external_tickets_url\":\"https://tickets.showroomcinema.org.uk/showroomworkstation/website/ChooseSeats.aspx?EventInstanceId=928001\",\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":true,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":0,\"ticket_buckets\":[],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04afc\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"King of the Jews\",\"sort_key\":\"King of the Jews\",\"description\":\"<p>When Alice and Benj's eight-year-old Jewish son, Ezra, is cast as King Herod in his school Nativity, the couple clash over whether to intervene. The debate escalates as the two argue over who has final say in an interfaith family. Benj, playing the ‘Jewish card’, insists they should stay out of it, scarred by memories of his own overbearing parents, that is, until he sees Ezra's gleefully murderous rehearsal.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788344937313temp-1788344937283-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788344937509temp-1788344937488-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788344937062temp-1788344936948-still.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"7\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Katie Lambert\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527d\",\"name\":\"Pears Short Film Fund\",\"color\":\"#ff8fdc\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.550Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-02T10:28:56.946Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04afe\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"Fish, Chips & Faith\",\"sort_key\":\"Fish, Chips & Faith\",\"description\":\"<p>Fish, Chips & Faith tells the uplifting story of a Leeds restaurant bringing communities together by serving Kosher and Halal food under one roof.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931926719temp-1787931926616-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931925569temp-1787931925377-poster.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"6\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Micaela Blitz, Miriam Rosenberg\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478526b\",\"name\":\"Dangoor UKJF Short Doc Fund\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.556Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-09T11:19:34.628Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b06\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"Rambling\",\"sort_key\":\"Rambling\",\"description\":\"<p>Over the last 50 years The Pennine Wayfarers have become a community all of their own. Combining friendship and adventure, they travel a route that resonates with British-Jewish history.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931934825temp-1787931934741-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931933876temp-1787931933813-poster.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"6\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Jack Levy\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478526b\",\"name\":\"Dangoor UKJF Short Doc Fund\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.572Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-09T11:18:46.060Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b0b\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"Rachel Jones Needs a Boyfriend Not a Bat-Mitzvah\",\"sort_key\":\"Rachel Jones Needs a Boyfriend Not a Bat-Mitzvah\",\"description\":\"<p>Rachel Jones follows a young Welsh Jewish girl on her quest for a boyfriend, while also trying to prepare for her upcoming Bat Mitzvah.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931939299temp-1787931939249-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931938446temp-1787931938410-poster.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"15\",\"language\":\"English, Welsh\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"subtitle_language\":\"English\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Talia Smith\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b09\",\"name\":\"Changing Perspectives Film Fund\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b0c\",\"name\":\"Welsh Language\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b0d\",\"name\":\"English Subtitles\",\"color\":\"#3697ff\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.580Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.580Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b00\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"The Last Jewel\",\"sort_key\":\"Last Jewel, The\",\"description\":\"<p>At 89, Joseph Ullmann keeps the tradition of his grandfather’s Budapest antique jewellery business alive. In today's Hatton Garden, he and his shop are the last of their kind.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931928687temp-1787931928661-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931927770temp-1787931927748-poster.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"5\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Rob Kaplan\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478526b\",\"name\":\"Dangoor UKJF Short Doc Fund\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.561Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.561Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b08\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"The Dead Parent Club\",\"sort_key\":\"Dead Parent Club, The\",\"description\":\"<p>Ollie’s dad has unexpectedly died, and neither is ready to let go. With an unlikely sidekick, Ollie embarks on a chaotic, thoughtful quest for peace.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789384640832temp-1789384640425-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789384641823temp-1789384641080-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789384635564temp-1789384634882-still.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"15\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Mark Fleischmann\",\"producer\":\"Jesse Romain\",\"screenwriter\":\"Mark Fleischmann\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b09\",\"name\":\"Changing Perspectives Film Fund\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.576Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-14T11:17:20.423Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b04\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"Oslo Court\",\"sort_key\":\"Oslo Court\",\"description\":\"<p>A film about the 1970s-style London restaurant, Oslo Court, and its cultural importance to the Jewish community, with waiter, Neil, at its beating heart.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931932656temp-1787931932612-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931931811temp-1787931931771-poster.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"5\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Hermione Oldham\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478526b\",\"name\":\"Dangoor UKJF Short Doc Fund\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.569Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.569Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b02\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"Mizrahi Mismatch\",\"sort_key\":\"Mizrahi Mismatch\",\"description\":\"<p>Judith and Menahem met in 1959, and wed within weeks. They are fire and water, ghormeh sabzi and gachun, yet somehow have survived 67 years together.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1790069967722temp-1790069967536-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1790069948628temp-1790069948303-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1790069967292temp-1790069966985-still.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"5\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Misha Mansoor\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478526b\",\"name\":\"Dangoor UKJF Short Doc Fund\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.565Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-22T09:39:26.982Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04afa\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"The Goyfriend\",\"sort_key\":\"Goyfriend, The\",\"description\":\"<p>Aviva is excited to bring James to his first Passover Seder, until her parents admit that grandma has no idea that her potential future grandson-in-law isn’t Jewish. Determined to keep the peace, Aviva’s family attempt to pass James off as 'one of us'.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789395207832temp-1789395207615-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789395225063temp-1789395224739-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789395224557temp-1789395224245-still.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"17\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Ashley Margolis\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527d\",\"name\":\"Pears Short Film Fund\",\"color\":\"#ff8fdc\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.542Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-14T14:13:44.244Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-13T10:27:36.421Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{\"cover\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1791217414990temp-1791217414863-cover.jpg\",\"avatar\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1791217415269temp-1791217415181-avatar.jpg\"},\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[]},{\"id\":\"6aa80388d60d7c117dcc4b1c\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"The Last Concert\",\"description\":\"<h4>This film will be shown in Cinema 1</h4><p><strong>PRICES:</strong></p><p><strong>Adult Standard: £11.15</strong></p><p><strong>Concession (Student, Senior Citizen): £9.15</strong></p><p><strong>Unwaged: £7.95</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Tickets for this event are sold directly through HOME Cinema Manchester. Clicking the \\\"Order Tickets\\\" button will take you to their booking website.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For all enquiries relating to your booking, please contact HOME directly.</p><p>Box Office: 0161 200 1500</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\\\"background-color: rgb(43, 41, 37); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">This screening will begin at the advertised time with no ads or trailers.</strong></p>\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"HOME Manchester\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47851f0\",\"name\":\"HOME Manchester\",\"short_name\":\"HOME Manchester\",\"description\":\"For all booking enquiries, please call the venue directly: 0161 200 1500\",\"address\":\"2 Tony Wilson Place\\nManchester\\nM15 4FN\",\"default_capacity\":null,\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"use_reserved_seating\":false,\"comscore_include\":false},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-12-02T18:30:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-12-02T20:30:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6aa7f91cd5377103a57d3463\",\"name\":\"Manchester\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":false,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"external_tickets_url\":\"https://www.homemcr.org/spektrix/ChooseSeats?EventInstanceId=2039401ANMSMBPBJPSHJGJTPNBRHQLQTM\",\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":true,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":0,\"ticket_buckets\":[],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a8f21f1577ecc984c485fa4\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"The Last Concert\",\"sort_key\":\"Last Concert, The\",\"description\":\"<p>A thrilling cat-and-mouse psychological drama from legendary director, Alexandre Arcady, who won Best Film at the 2024 UK Jewish Film Festival with Once Upon a Time in Algeria. Renowned but tyrannical classical composer, Alexandre Miller (Benoît Poelvoorde), performs a farewell concert at the iconic Opéra-Comique in Paris, before he leaves to take over the Berlin Philharmonic. After the performance, a man named Dinkel (Kad Merad) arrives. He claims to be a super-fan of Miller, and insists on a private audience with his hero. As Dinkel relentlessly pursues Miller through the labyrinthine corridors of the opera house, dark secrets from their past begin to emerge.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931964715temp-1787931964612-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931963742temp-1787931963464-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787765544906temp-1787765544380-still.jpg\",\"trailer_url\":\"https://youtu.be/v-1Ue9codho\",\"unballoted\":true,\"details\":{\"country\":\"Belgium, France\",\"language\":\"French\",\"runtime\":\"89\",\"subtitle_language\":\"English\",\"year\":\"2026\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Alexandre Arcady\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b23\",\"name\":\"French Language\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527c\",\"name\":\"Drama\",\"color\":\"#f9b6df\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b0d\",\"name\":\"English Subtitles\",\"color\":\"#3697ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527f\",\"name\":\"Comedy\",\"color\":\"#ffdeee\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b32\",\"name\":\"Comedy Drama\",\"color\":\"#3697ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785281\",\"name\":\"Gala Film\",\"color\":\"#ffc636\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b40\",\"name\":\"Closing Night Gala\",\"color\":\"#608ea4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527e\",\"name\":\"Feature Film\",\"color\":\"#c78fff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-26T17:27:13.243Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-14T15:25:22.381Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-12T16:30:22.508Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{},\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[]},{\"id\":\"6aa80388d60d7c117dcc4b20\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"British-Jewish Life on Film: Glasgow\",\"description\":\"<h4>This film will be shown in Screen 1</h4><p>We are proud to present <em>British Jewish Life on Film 2026: </em>an evening of brand new films about British Jewish life. These films were all commissioned this year by UKJF's Film Factory, with the aim of demonstrating the absolute diversity of our community. A series of mini-documentaries and short dramas tell Jewish stories from the length and breadth of the UK.</p><p><br></p><p>You'll laugh, you'll cry, you'll be entertained, you'll discover things you didn't know, and just by turning up to the screening you'll meet other local members of the Jewish community.</p><p><br></p><p>Above all else, you're guaranteed to leave feeling a renewed sense of Jewish pride.&nbsp;</p>\",\"short_description\":\"\",\"location\":\"Everyman Glasgow Screen 1\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47851f7\",\"name\":\"Everyman Glasgow Screen 1\",\"short_name\":\"Everyman Glasgow Scr1\",\"description\":\"For all booking enquiries, please call the UK Jewish Film Box Office on 020 3176 0048\",\"address\":\"Unit 3–5 Princes Square Buchanan St\\nGlasgow G1 3JN\",\"default_capacity\":null,\"color\":\"#ffbc57\",\"use_reserved_seating\":true,\"comscore_include\":false,\"seatmap_id\":\"fb383506-0a7e-57e8-60ff-3f0a5f50ecf4\",\"seatmap_categories\":[{\"key\":\"1\",\"label\":\"2-Seater Sofa: £30.00 in total\",\"color\":\"#286A22\",\"_id\":\"6accc67ae4c498dd43dd8a07\"},{\"key\":\"2\",\"label\":\"Single Armchair\",\"color\":\"#CD254A\",\"_id\":\"6accc67ae4c498dd43dd8a08\"},{\"key\":\"3\",\"label\":\"Wheelchair Space\",\"color\":\"#4176A5\",\"_id\":\"6accc67ae4c498dd43dd8a09\"},{\"key\":\"4\",\"label\":\"Companion Seat\",\"color\":\"#49A3BA\",\"_id\":\"6accc67ae4c498dd43dd8a0a\"},{\"key\":\"5\",\"label\":\"Unavailable\",\"color\":\"#878787\",\"_id\":\"6accc67ae4c498dd43dd8a0b\"}]},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2026-12-03T18:15:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2026-12-03T20:15:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6aa7f91cd5377103a57d3460\",\"name\":\"British Jewish Life on Film\",\"color\":\"#ff8fdc\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":false,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"show_custom_checkout_message\":false,\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":true,\"tickets_available\":false,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":0,\"ticket_buckets\":[],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04afc\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"King of the Jews\",\"sort_key\":\"King of the Jews\",\"description\":\"<p>When Alice and Benj's eight-year-old Jewish son, Ezra, is cast as King Herod in his school Nativity, the couple clash over whether to intervene. The debate escalates as the two argue over who has final say in an interfaith family. Benj, playing the ‘Jewish card’, insists they should stay out of it, scarred by memories of his own overbearing parents, that is, until he sees Ezra's gleefully murderous rehearsal.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788344937313temp-1788344937283-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788344937509temp-1788344937488-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1788344937062temp-1788344936948-still.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"7\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Katie Lambert\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527d\",\"name\":\"Pears Short Film Fund\",\"color\":\"#ff8fdc\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.550Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-02T10:28:56.946Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04afe\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"Fish, Chips & Faith\",\"sort_key\":\"Fish, Chips & Faith\",\"description\":\"<p>Fish, Chips & Faith tells the uplifting story of a Leeds restaurant bringing communities together by serving Kosher and Halal food under one roof.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931926719temp-1787931926616-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931925569temp-1787931925377-poster.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"6\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Micaela Blitz, Miriam Rosenberg\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478526b\",\"name\":\"Dangoor UKJF Short Doc Fund\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.556Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-09T11:19:34.628Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b06\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"Rambling\",\"sort_key\":\"Rambling\",\"description\":\"<p>Over the last 50 years The Pennine Wayfarers have become a community all of their own. Combining friendship and adventure, they travel a route that resonates with British-Jewish history.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931934825temp-1787931934741-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931933876temp-1787931933813-poster.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"6\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Jack Levy\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478526b\",\"name\":\"Dangoor UKJF Short Doc Fund\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.572Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-09T11:18:46.060Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b0b\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"Rachel Jones Needs a Boyfriend Not a Bat-Mitzvah\",\"sort_key\":\"Rachel Jones Needs a Boyfriend Not a Bat-Mitzvah\",\"description\":\"<p>Rachel Jones follows a young Welsh Jewish girl on her quest for a boyfriend, while also trying to prepare for her upcoming Bat Mitzvah.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931939299temp-1787931939249-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931938446temp-1787931938410-poster.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"15\",\"language\":\"English, Welsh\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"subtitle_language\":\"English\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Talia Smith\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b09\",\"name\":\"Changing Perspectives Film Fund\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b0c\",\"name\":\"Welsh Language\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b0d\",\"name\":\"English Subtitles\",\"color\":\"#3697ff\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.580Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.580Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b00\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"The Last Jewel\",\"sort_key\":\"Last Jewel, The\",\"description\":\"<p>At 89, Joseph Ullmann keeps the tradition of his grandfather’s Budapest antique jewellery business alive. In today's Hatton Garden, he and his shop are the last of their kind.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931928687temp-1787931928661-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931927770temp-1787931927748-poster.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"5\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Rob Kaplan\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478526b\",\"name\":\"Dangoor UKJF Short Doc Fund\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.561Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.561Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b08\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"The Dead Parent Club\",\"sort_key\":\"Dead Parent Club, The\",\"description\":\"<p>Ollie’s dad has unexpectedly died, and neither is ready to let go. With an unlikely sidekick, Ollie embarks on a chaotic, thoughtful quest for peace.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789384640832temp-1789384640425-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789384641823temp-1789384641080-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789384635564temp-1789384634882-still.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"15\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Mark Fleischmann\",\"producer\":\"Jesse Romain\",\"screenwriter\":\"Mark Fleischmann\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b09\",\"name\":\"Changing Perspectives Film Fund\",\"color\":\"#8d95ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.576Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-14T11:17:20.423Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b04\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"Oslo Court\",\"sort_key\":\"Oslo Court\",\"description\":\"<p>A film about the 1970s-style London restaurant, Oslo Court, and its cultural importance to the Jewish community, with waiter, Neil, at its beating heart.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931932656temp-1787931932612-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1787931931811temp-1787931931771-poster.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"5\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Hermione Oldham\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478526b\",\"name\":\"Dangoor UKJF Short Doc Fund\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.569Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.569Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04b02\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"Mizrahi Mismatch\",\"sort_key\":\"Mizrahi Mismatch\",\"description\":\"<p>Judith and Menahem met in 1959, and wed within weeks. They are fire and water, ghormeh sabzi and gachun, yet somehow have survived 67 years together.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1790069967722temp-1790069967536-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1790069948628temp-1790069948303-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1790069967292temp-1790069966985-still.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"5\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Misha Mansoor\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478526b\",\"name\":\"Dangoor UKJF Short Doc Fund\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.565Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-22T09:39:26.982Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"6a91ad0c20625c9624c04afa\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc47850df\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"UK Jewish Film Festival 2026\",\"owner_id\":\"5eabd86394261c0075794000\",\"name\":\"The Goyfriend\",\"sort_key\":\"Goyfriend, The\",\"description\":\"<p>Aviva is excited to bring James to his first Passover Seder, until her parents admit that grandma has no idea that her potential future grandson-in-law isn’t Jewish. Determined to keep the peace, Aviva’s family attempt to pass James off as 'one of us'.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789395207832temp-1789395207615-cover.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789395225063temp-1789395224739-poster.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1789395224557temp-1789395224245-still.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2026\",\"runtime\":\"17\",\"language\":\"English\",\"country\":\"UK\"},\"credits\":{\"director\":\"Ashley Margolis\"},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc478527d\",\"name\":\"Pears Short Film Fund\",\"color\":\"#ff8fdc\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785271\",\"name\":\"Short Film\",\"color\":\"#cef2ec\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785275\",\"name\":\"Cinema Screening\",\"color\":\"#36e2ff\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785276\",\"name\":\"UK Premiere\",\"color\":\"#9df210\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785274\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"color\":\"#7ac1f4\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"6a3000f01f63771bc4785270\",\"name\":\"Browse All Films\",\"color\":\"#51b4a1\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T15:45:16.542Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09